        "tipp_is_for_acute_distress_not": "🆘 TIPP yog rau kev nyuaj siab HNYAV TAM SIM, tsis yog kev ntxhov siab txhua hnub. ",
        "tipp_is_for_acute_distress_the": "TIPP yog rau kev nyuaj siab HNYAV TAM SIM: lub sij hawm koj tab tom yuav ua ib yam koj mam khuv xim, lossis xav tias koj ua siab ntev hla 5 feeb tom ntej tsis tau. Nws TSIS yog rau kev ntxhov siab txhua hnub, lub siab poob qis, lossis kev xav txhawj xeeb. TIPP ceev, siv lub cev, thiab tsim los yuav ob peb feeb tom ntej kom kev tham, kev xav, lossis kev thov kev pab rov ua tau. Yog koj nyob rau hauv xwm txheej nyhav, thov siv Crisis Companion lossis hu 988 / sau ntawv HOME xa rau 741741.",
        "tipp_is_most_useful_when_students": "TIPP muaj txiaj ntsig tshaj plaws thaum cov tub kawm tau xyaum ib lossis ob zaug thaum lub sij hawm Crew, tsis yog thawj zaug ntsib hauv xwm txheej nyhav. Ib txoj kev Crew yooj yim: ua ib lub txuj ci TIPP ua ke (kev ua pa raws sij hawm yooj yim tshaj hauv chav kawm), qhia lwm peb lub, mam qhia cov tub kawm txog lub cuab yeej no. Siv ua ke nrog Crisis Companion rau ib tug tub kawm twg uas qhia cov cim nyuaj siab hnyav tam sim.",
        "tipp_is_part_of_the_distress": "TIPP yog ib feem ntawm ntu Distress Tolerance ntawm Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT), tsim los ntawm Marsha Linehan txij xyoo 1980s. Linehan tsim DBT rau cov neeg uas muaj kev xav hnyav thiab teb sai, thawj zaug rau cov neeg mob uas xav tua tus kheej ntev thiab muaj borderline personality disorder. Cov txuj ci Distress Tolerance tsim los rau lub sij hawm \"hla xwm txheej nyhav\" uas lub hom phiaj tsuas yog tsis txhob ua rau phem zuj zus rau ob peb feeb tom ntej. Tam sim no TIPP raug qhia dav hauv kev noj qab haus huv ntawm lub siab rau menyuam yaus, cov tsev kawm ntawv nkag siab txog kev mob siab, thiab cov pab pawg kawm txuj ci DBT.",
