      "cmp_contempt_bodyFeels_4": "puab tsaig nruj",
      "cmp_contempt_definition_elementary": "Kev saib tsis taus yog thaum koj saib ib tug neeg qis dua koj. Nws txawv ntawm kev npau taws, nws xav tias txias siab dua.",
      "cmp_contempt_definition_high": "Kev saib tsis taus yog kev xyaw kev qias neeg + kev npau taws uas qhia tias koj xav tias koj siab dua. Gottman txoj kev tshawb fawb teem nws ua ib lub cim ceeb toom loj tshaj plaws tias kev sib raug zoo yuav xaus.",
      "cmp_contempt_definition_middle": "Kev saib tsis taus xyaw kev qias neeg nrog kev npau taws. Nws qhia lwm tus tias \"koj tsis tsim nyog kuv hwm.\" Nws yog ib qho kev xav uas ua puas kev sib raug zoo tshaj plaws.",
      "cmp_contempt_feelsLike": "Kev ntsia txias siab. Tig qhov muag los hauv nruab siab. Lwm tus neeg me zuj zus hauv koj lub siab.",
      "cmp_contempt_helpfulNext_0": "nug seb qhov xav tau dab tsi tsis tau txais (feem ntau yog kev hwm lossis kev ncaj ncees)",
