      "cmp_disapproval_bodyFeels_4": "ua pa ntev me me",
      "cmp_disapproval_definition_elementary": "Kev tsis pom zoo yog thaum muaj ib yam tshwm sim uas koj tsis tau cia siab THIAB koj tsis nyiam. Xws li thaum ib tug phooj ywg ua txhaum txoj cai uas tseem ceeb rau koj.",
      "cmp_disapproval_definition_high": "Kev tsis pom zoo yog kev sib xyaw ntawm kev xav tsis thoob thiab kev tu siab. Nws qhia txog kev ua txhaum qhov cia siab lossis nuj nqis yam tsis nce mus ua kev npau taws. Feem ntau yog thawj lub cim tias kev sib raug zoo tau txav deb ntawm koj cov qauv.",
      "cmp_disapproval_definition_middle": "Kev tsis pom zoo xyaw kev xav tsis thoob nrog kev tu siab. Ib yam dab tsi tau ua txhaum qhov koj xav tias yuav tshwm sim, ces tam sim no koj tu siab.",
      "cmp_disapproval_feelsLike": "Lub siab poob me ntsis, ntxiv rau lo lus ntsiag to tias \"Kuv tsis xav tias koj yuav ua li ntawd.\"",
