      "cmp_submission_definition_high": "Kev ua raws siab yog kev xyaw kev ntseeg siab thiab kev ntshai. Nws hloov tau zoo (ua raws kws tshaj lij) lossis ua phem tau (ua raws vim raug yuam). Lo lus nug yog seb koj xaiv los yog raug yuam.",
