      "color_returning_to_red_the_wheel_closes__reason": "Rov qab mus rau xim liab. Lub log kaw rov qab qhov nws pib.",
      "color_sky_and_water_blue_is_calming_and__reason": "Xim xiav ntuj thiab dej ua kom siab tus thiab ntseeg siab — tab sis lus Askiv (\"feeling blue\") kuj txuas nws rau kev tu siab me ntsis thiab.",
      "color_teal_cyan_blends_green_s_calm_with_reason": "Xim ntsuab xiav xyaw kev siab tus ntawm xim ntsuab nrog kev ntseeg ntawm xim xiav — ua kom siab tus thoob kab lis kev cai.",
      "color_yellow_correlates_with_happiness_i_reason": "Xim daj txuas nrog kev zoo siab hauv feem ntau kab lis kev cai, tab sis xim daj ci heev yuav zoo li txhawj xeeb (cov paib ceeb toom siv nws vim li ntawd).",
