      "strat_anger_high_conn2_name": "Taug Kev Nrog Ib Tug Neeg",
      "strat_anger_high_conn2_step0": "Thov ib tug neeg taug kev nrog koj, tsis tas yuav tham",
      "strat_anger_high_conn2_step1": "Taug kev ceev",
      "strat_anger_high_conn2_step2": "Taug kev kom kev chim ploj mus",
      "strat_anger_high_crisisEscalation": "Yog koj tab tom yuav ua phem rau lwm tus lossis koj tus kheej: hu 911 yog phom sij tam sim. Lwm yam hu 988 lossis sau ntawv HOME xa rau 741741 tam sim no. Tawm hauv cheeb tsam yog nyab xeeb.",
      "strat_anger_high_shortDesc": "Suab nrov, lub cev tshee, lus tawm nrawm; xav nplawm, pov khoom, lossis qw; qhov muag pom nqaim.",
