      "strat_anger_high_whenItPersists": "Kev npau taws hnyav ntau tshaj ib zaug ib lub lim tiam, lossis ua rau koj lossis lwm tus ntshai, tsim nyog ntsib kws kho siab lub hli no.",
      "strat_anxiety_panic_attack_body0_dur": "2 feeb",
      "strat_anxiety_panic_attack_body0_name": "Dej Txias Qhib Txoj Kev Dhia Dej",
      "strat_anxiety_panic_attack_body0_step0": "Sau dej txias rau hauv ib lub tais",
