      "strat_anxiety_panic_attack_shortDesc": "Tshwm sim tam sim: plawv dhia nrov, hauv siab nruj, tes loog, kiv taub hau, ntshai tuag lossis tswj tsis tau. Siab tshaj hauv ~10 feeb.",
