    "student_extra_check": "Xyuas koj txoj haujlwm rau lwm txoj kev. Yog tias ob txoj kev pom zoo, piav qhia seb vim li cas qhov ntawd ua rau koj ntseeg siab ntxiv.",
    "student_extra_transfer": "Xav txog ib qho xwm txheej tshiab uas lub tswv yim no yuav tseem ceeb. Piav seb koj yuav ua li cas thiab vim li cas.",
    "student_extra_compare": "Xaiv ob qho piv txwv los yog ob lub tswv yim. Hais ib yam zoo sib xws uas tseem ceeb thiab ib yam txawv uas tseem ceeb.",
    "student_extra_cause": "Taug ib txoj saw ntawm qhov ua rau thiab qhov tshwm sim. Piav seb muaj dab tsi tshwm sim, vim li cas thiaj tshwm sim, thiab dab tsi tshwm sim tom qab.",
    "student_extra_explain": "Piav qhia koj txoj kev xav zoo li koj tab tom pab ib tug phooj ywg hauv chav uas nyuam qhuav pom lub tswv yim thawj zaug.",
    "student_extra_sequence": "Muab cov kauj ruam los yog tswv yim tseem ceeb tso ua ntu zus, ces piav qhia seb vim li cas kev ua ntu zus li ntawd thiaj tsim nyog.",
    "student_extra_create": "Rau tus kawm, chaw pab: tsim.",
