    "educator_plan_ready": "Koj txoj kev npaj qhia ntawv npaj txhij lawm. Thov xyuas qhov ceev, kev hloov mus, cov neeg kawm cov kev xaiv, thiab qhov chaw uas koj yuav sau pov thawj ntawm kev to taub.",
