    "educator_inquiry_ready": "Koj qhov kev tshawb nrhiav qhov chaw npaj txhij lawm. Thov xyuas qhov sib txawv ntawm cov qhov chaw thiab nug cov neeg kawm kom txuas cov lus lees, pov thawj, thiab laj thawj.",
