    "simplified_citations": "Qhib ua qhov qub. Khaws qhov chaw hais txog thiab cov txuas hauv ntawv kho lawm kiag li qub. Kaw nws kom tshem cov txuas. Tswv yim: cia qhib rau ntawv qhov tseeb.",
