    "visuals_low_quality": "ceev up duab tiam by reducing quality. Low quality hom: tsim hauv 2-3 vib nas (vs 8-10), siv tsawg API kev pab cuam, tsim smaller cov ntaub ntawv sizes, thiab yog adequate rau most chav kawm tso tawm. Trade-offs: tsawg kev meej, lower resolution, simpler compositions. Perfect rau: rapid prototyping, testing cov lus qhia, thiab pkev tshuaj xyuas purposes. Hloov mus siab quality rau final version. Low quality yog often sufficient thaum projected los yog viewed rau saum screen. Luam tawm cov khoom siv benefit los ntawm siab quality. kev teeb tsa applies mus tshiab generations only. cov lus qhia: Siv low quality during zaj lus qhia planning, siab quality rau polished cov khoom siv.",
    "visuals_art_style": "Tshwm thaum teem Hloov rau yam khoom qhia no: Isometric, Duab Pixel, Xim Dej, Qauv Npaj, Duab Lom Zem, Kos Kab, Duab 3D, los yog Koj Teem.",
    "visuals_custom_instructions": "Provide meej guidance rau duab tiam. Describe: tshwj xeeb objects mus suav nrog, qhov chaw kev teeb tsa thiab background, tus cwj pwm appearances, mood thiab atmosphere, thiab composition preferences. piv txwv: scientist hauv chav kawm tshawb fawb coat examining plant under microscope, Children playing hauv schoolyard rau saum sunny day. ntau tshwj xeeb cov lus qhia tsim ntau accurate cov txiaj ntsig. Suav nrog: subject, action, kev teeb tsa, thiab hom kev meej. Avoid: inappropriate cov ntsiab (filtered), copyrighted tus cwj pwm, real people. AI interprets creatively—cov txiaj ntsig may vary los ntawm exact description. Tsim ntau times rau kev xaiv. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog essential elements, ntxiv kev meej yog tias needed.",
