    "scaffolds_type": "Xaiv scaffold hom qhov ntawd best kev txhawb koj kev kawm objective. kab lus Starters: provide beginning ntawm thoughts rau tub ntxhais kawm mus ua kom tiav ( main idea yog..., Qhov no reminds me ntawm...). nqe lus Frames: offer structured templates nrog blanks rau full nqe lus construction. Discussion Cov lus qhia: qhib-ended lo lus nug qhov ntawd guide verbal los yog written exploration. Xaiv raws rau saum: tub ntxhais kawm kev txawj theem (starters yog most supportive), task type (sau ntawv vs. speaking), thiab independence lub hom phiaj (frames tsim toward independent sau ntawv). Mix types within zaj lus qhia rau varied kev txhawb. cov lus qhia: Pib nrog ntau structured scaffolds thiab gradually tshem kev txhawb as tub ntxhais kawm develop kev txawj.",
    "scaffolds_custom_instructions": "Hloov raws siab nyiam scaffold cov ntsiab rau tshwj xeeb purposes. Hais kom meej rhetorical functions: agreeing/disagreeing, comparing/contrasting, cause/effect, pov thawj citation, los yog claim-reason-pov thawj. piv txwv: Tsim starters rau politely disagreeing nrog peer, Focus rau saum analyzing tus cwj pwm motivation, Suav nrog frames rau synthesizing ntau sources. cov lus qhia duab hom lus cov qauv thiab academic cov lus tau siv. Perfect rau: targeted kev txawj development, genre-tshwj xeeb sau ntawv, thiab Socratic seminar preparation. Scaffolds tuaj yeem homl sophisticated academic hom lus while remaining pom tau. cov lus qhia: Align scaffold hom lus nrog koj sau ntawv rubric criteria.",
    "brainstorm_simulation_type": "Xaiv hom app uas Canvas lus qhia yuav tsim: Web App los yog Kev Ua Si Sib Cuam Tshuam (React), Kev Tshuaj Xyuas Ntaub Ntawv & Duab (Python), Kev Sim Physics Duab (p5.js), los yog AI Tus Neeg Sib Tham rau kev ua neeg hauv keeb kwm.",
    "brainstorm_step_count": "Teem seb muaj pes tsawg kab lus qhia Canvas, txij 1 txog 10 (qhov qub 5). Txhua kab ntxiv rau app ib kauj ruam zuj zus. Lo txhua kab rau hauv Gemini Canvas raws txheej txheem. Tswv yim: 4 txog 6 kauj ruam haum feem ntau cov app zaj lus qhia.",
    "brainstorm_custom_instructions": "Define focus thiab constraints rau brainstorming. Hais kom meej: problem mus daws teeb meem, conntawv nyeem los yog scenario, constraints mus consider, roles los yog perspectives mus suav nrog, thiab desired outcomes. piv txwv: Brainstorm solutions mus reduce tsev kawm ntawv cafeteria waste, Nrhiav xyuas yuav ua li cas historical figures would react mus homrn technology, Tsim ideas rau community service project. Clear conntawv nyeem tsim ntau focused, relevant brainstorming. Suav nrog any real-world constraints tub ntxhais kawm should consider. AI maintains focus throughout simulation. cov lus qhia: Frame cov teeb meem as qhib-ended kev sib tw nrog ntau valid approaches.",
    "brainstorm_generate_button": "Sau ib pawg lus qhia ib kauj ruam zuj zus, raws koj cov ntawv qhov chaw thiab hom app saum toj no, kom koj lo rau hauv Gemini Canvas tsim app sib cuam tshuam rau koj zaj lus qhia. Xav tau cov ntawv qhov chaw. Tswv yim: lo cov lus qhia raws txheej txheem thiab sim tom qab txhua kauj ruam.",
    "timeline_topic": "Hais kom meej different focus rau timeline tiam. By default: AI extracts primary cov ncauj lus los ntawm koj qhov chaw cov ntawv. Override mus: narrow focus mus tshwj xeeb aspect, broaden mus related context, los yog redirect mus connected cov ncauj lus. piv txwv: yog tias qhov chaw yog txog WWII, override mus Battle ntawm Midway rau tshwj xeeb focus, los yog Causes ntawm WWII rau analytical timeline. Custom topics still kos los ntawm qhov chaw cov ntsiab qhov twg relevant. Leave blank mus siv AI-detected cov ncauj lus. Custom cov ncauj lus must be related mus qhov chaw rau coherent cov txiaj ntsig. cov lus qhia: Siv kev nyiam topics mus tsim ntau timelines los ntawm tib yam qhov chaw nrog different focuses.",
    "timeline_count": "Xaiv tau. Teem pes tsawg yam hauv txheej txheem, 3 txog 20, los cia khoob kom AI xaiv. Kho, ntxiv los tshem tau tom qab tsim. Tswv yim: 8-10 yam zoo tshaj.",
    "outline_structure": "Xaiv tus qauv duab npaj. Kev xaiv: Daim Duab Venn (qhov qub), T-Chart, Pob Txha Ntses, Daim Ntawv Npaj Muaj Qauv, Daim Duab Tswv Yim Tseem Ceeb, Daim Duab Txheej Txheem, Qhov Chaw Tsim Thiab Qhov Tshwm Sim, Teeb Meem & Kev Daws, Qauv Frayer, Daim Duab KWL, Kev Hais-Pov Thawj-Laj Thawj, Daim Duab Dab Neeg, Pom-Xav-Xav Paub, Chaw Tswv Yim 3D thiab Tsev Vaj Ntxwv Kev Nco. Tswv yim: xaiv tus qauv haum rau txoj kev xav uas koj xav kom tub ntxhais kawm xyaum.",
    "outline_custom_instructions": "Guide AI focus within outline. Hais kom meej: key lub tswv yim qhov ntawd must be suav nrog, relationships mus emphasize, tob rau particular tshooj, los yog structural preferences. piv txwv: Emphasize economic factors, Qhia yuav ua li cas txhua tus cwj pwm motivation connects mus ntsiab lus, Ensure tag nrho cov lus lo lus tshwm sim as nodes. cov lus qhia duab: dab tsi yog suav nrog, yuav ua li cas it yog organized, thiab qhov twg emphasis falls. Custom cov lus qhia tsim ntau targeted, curriculum-aligned outlines. Leave blank rau balanced, comprehensive outline. cov lus qhia: Align outline focus nrog kev ntsuam xyuas objectives so tub ntxhais kawm study dab tsi matters most.",
    "concept_sort_categories": "Xaiv tau. Tis npe cov pawg uas tub ntxhais kawm yuav faib, piv txwv li Muaj Sia thiab Tsis Muaj Sia, los yog Qhov Tseeb thiab Kev Xav. Sau ib pawg thiab nias Enter; ntxiv txog 5 pawg. Cia khoob kom AI xaiv cov pawg. Tswv yim: 2 los yog 3 pawg meej zoo tshaj.",
    "fullpack_auto_config": "Analyzes koj cov ntsiab ntev, kev nyuaj, thiab cov ncauj lus mus auto-xaiv appropriate kev pab cuam. Zoo rau ceev setup—kaw mus manually pick txhua feem.",
    "fullpack_resource_count": "Qhov loj ntawm pob: pes tsawg yam khoom qhia Cia Li Teeb npaj tau. Xaiv Cia li, Luv (5), Qub (8), Tob (12), los yog Txhua Lub Cuab Yeej. Tsawg dua ceev dua thiab tsom zoo; ntau dua npog dav dua. Tswv yim: pib nrog Luv los yog Qub.",
    "quiz_question_count": "Control kev sim ntev rau appropriate kev ntsuam xyuas. Range: 3 lo lus nug (ceev check) mus 25 lo lus nug (comprehensive kev ntsuam xyuas). Shorter kev sim: formative checks, exit tickets, warm-ups. Longer kev sim: unit kev ntsuam xyuas, thorough kev nkag siab evaluation. Consider: cov ntsiab coverage needed, muaj time, thiab tub ntxhais kawm fatigue. AI distributes lo lus nug across cov ntsiab topics. lo lus nug distribution tuaj yeem be weighted toward tshwj xeeb thaj av siv kev nyiam cov lus qhia. ntau lo lus nug provide zoo dua cov ncauj lus tab sis require ntau time. cov lus qhia: 5-10 lo lus nug ua hauj lwm well rau daily formative kev ntsuam xyuas; khaws longer kev sim rau summative evaluation.",
