    "venn_drop_zone_shared": "intersection zone rau yam nrog shared attributes. Tso yam here qhov ntawd belong mus BOTH pawg simultaneously. Qhov no yog often most challenging zone—requires understanding qhov ntawd yam tuaj yeem sib koom attributes los ntawm ntau pawg. piv txwv: tomato (fruit AND vegetable siv), platypus (mammal AND egg-laying), documentary (entertainment AND education). yam correctly placed here demonstrate higher-order thinking. Feem ntau misconception: qee tub ntxhais kawm avoid qhov no zone, so encourage considering dab tsi two pawg might sib koom. Provides explicit xyaum nrog Venn duab piav qhia intersections before siv them hauv analysis.",
    "crossword_game_container": "Kev sib tshuam lo lus tsim los ntawm koj phau ntawv qhia lus; lus qhia zais yog lawv lub ntsiab lus. Nyem ib qhov thiab sau, siv ntus xub txav. Txhua qhov yog tau 2 qhab nia, ntxiv 100 rau kev ua tiav. Muaj Luam Tawm thiab phau lus teb rau xibfwb.",
