    "crossword_clues_list": "Qhov xa mus phab ntsa qhia tag nrho crossword clues organized by direction. ACROSS clues: nyeem left-mus-sab xis lo lus teb. DOWN clues: nyeem top-mus-bottom lo lus teb. Nyem any clue mus highlight its corresponding lub thawv hauv daim phiaj. Clue tus lej match numbered lub thawv hauv qhov yam ntxwv. Clues yog lub ntsiab los ntawm koj phau ntawv qhia lus—understanding clue yog key mus finding lo lus teb. Qee clues may be tricky los yog require inference. Siv cov lus qhia system yog tias completely stuck. Pro cov lus qhia: Pib nrog clues koj know confidently—filled letters become cov lus qhia rau intersecting lo lus. suab pob nias reads clues aloud yog tias muaj.",
    "crossword_controls": "Cov khawm sib tshuam lo lus. Luam Tawm luam kev ua si; xibfwb kuj tau Phau Lus Teb. Lus Qhia Zais sau ib qhov yuam kev los yog khoob (rho 1 qhab nia). Kuaj cim ntawv yuam kev liab thiab xaus thaum yog tag nrho. Qhia Tag Nrho sau txhua lo lus teb rau 0 qhab nia.",
    "group_modal_container": "Tswj Pawg & Khoom Qhia rau kev sib tham ncaj qha. Tsim pawg, xaiv khoom qhia rau txhua pawg, faib tub ntxhais kawm, thiab rov teeb khoom qhia. Rho pawg xa nws cov tub ntxhais kawm rov qab rau Tsis tau faib. Txhawb kev qhia faib qib thiab hloov chaw.",
    "group_create_input": "Tis npe koj pawg tshiab (piv txwv li Pawg Liab, Rooj 3, Sijhawm 2). Khaws npe kom luv thiab tsim nyog. Tsis muaj hloov npe; yuav hloov, rho tawm thiab tsim dua. Zam cov npe uas ua rau tub ntxhais kawm txaj muag.",
