    "group_resource_library": "Txhua yam khoom qhia hauv kev sib tham ncaj qha no, muaj lej raws txheej txheem. Rub ib daim npav los yog siv Ua Ntej/Tom Qab los hloov txheej txheem. Xa khoom qhia rau pawg siv pawg ntawd daim ntawv teev hauv qab Pawg Ua Haujlwm.",
    "group_active_list": "Cov pab pawg koj tsim hauv kev sib tham no. Txhua pawg qhia nws lub npe, X los rho tawm, thiab Khoom Qhia Muab Rau. Xaiv ib yam khoom qhia xa nws rau txhua tus tub ntxhais kawm hauv pawg ntawd. Siv rau kev qhia faib qib.",
    "group_roster_list": "Tub ntxhais kawm uas koom kev sib tham ncaj qha no. Lub teeb ntsuab txhais tias txuas lawm; txho txhais tias tsis txuas. Siv daim ntawv teev ib sab txhua lub npe los tso rau ib pawg, los yog Tsis tau faib. Khaws tam sim.",
    "header_language": "Teem hom lus ntawm AlloFlow cov khawm, npe thiab daim ntawv teev. Xaiv ib hom lus. Xaiv Koj Teem... los sau lwm hom lus. Hom lus interface cais ntawm hom lus ntawm koj cov ntsiab lus zaj lus qhia.",
