    "header_export": "Qhib cov kev xaiv xa tawm rau qhov chaw ua haujlwm tam sim no. cov ntawv Builder cia koj kuaj cov PDF, daim ntawv ua haujlwm, HTML thiab slide ua ntej tsim tawm. Cov pob LMS muaj lawv tus kheej txoj kev xa tawm. Cov ntsiab thiab cov yam ntxwv muaj nyob ntawm hom. Kuaj cov khoom siv koj xaiv thiab cov ntaub ntawv tawm ua ntej koj qhia rau lwm tus; kev xa tawm tsis lees paub kev nkag tau thiab tsis lav yuav haum txhua lub LMS.",
    "header_translate": "Txhais koj cov khoom qhia zaj lus qhia. Sau hom lus hom phiaj (piv txwv li Mev los yog Kauslim), xaiv seb puas ntxiv tsab ob hom lus, ces xaiv Txhais Tam Sim No los yog txhais tag nrho pob. Khaws tsab qub cia. Yuav hloov app cov khawm, siv tus xaiv hom lus hloov.",
    "header_submit": "tub ntxhais kawm submission pob nias rau completed assignments. thaum nyemed: koj current work yog packaged thiab sent mus xib fwb dashboard, timestamp yog recorded, thiab koj txais confirmation. Before submitting, ensure: tag nrho lo lus nug yog lus tebed, kev xavs yog thoughtful, thiab koj kev tshuaj xyuas koj work. After submission: koj cannot kho (prevents afterthought kev hloov), xib fwb yog notified, thiab koj XP yog finalized rau qhov no activity. yog tias koj need mus hloov something after submitting, ask koj xib fwb mus unlock koj submission. Submit only thaum truly finished—there yog no auto-khaws after submission. Confirmation screen qhia dab tsi was submitted.",
    "chat_input": "Koj txoj kev sib txuas lus nrog AlloBot, tus pab qhia AI. Nug txog yuav siv cov yam ntxwv li cas, tswv yim qhia, kev piav ntsiab lus, thiab kev pab txheej txheem. AlloBot paub koj thauj ntsiab lus dab tsi. Yuav hais hloov sau, siv Hais saum lub taub hau sib tham.",
