    "chat_framework_select": "Xaiv qauv txheej txheem kawm rau Tham Nrog AI Txog Tswv Yim. Kev xaiv: Common Core ELA, Common Core Lej, NGSS (science), C3 Framework (kev kawm zej zog), ISTE Standards, CASEL Competencies, thiab Texas TEKS. Hloov tau txhua lub sijhawm.",
    "chat_grade_select": "Teem qib kawm rau Tham Nrog AI Txog Tswv Yim: Kindergarten los yog qib 1 txog 12. Khawm xub nug AlloBot txog cov qauv kawm tseem ceeb rau qib no ntxiv tswv yim UDL. Cais ntawm qib kawm uas lwm lub cuab yeej siv.",
    "chat_consult_btn": "Nug AlloBot tswv yim kev sib haum. Nws xa ib tsab xov nug txog 2-3 qauv kawm tseem ceeb hauv tus qauv thiab qib kawm xaiv uas haum koj cov ntawv qhov chaw, ntxiv tswv yim UDL. Xav tau AI txuas lawm. Tswv yim: kuaj cov lej qauv kawm piv rau cov ntaub ntawv raug cai ua ntej siv.",
    "chat_autofill": "Pab kuv tsim ib zaj lus qhia. Qhib nws ces AlloBot siv koj kev teeb tsa zaj lus qhia tam sim no thiab kev sib tham tshiab no los pib txoj kev npaj zaj lus qhia kom koj kuaj. Yog twb muaj ntawv qhov chaw, nws nug seb yuav ua Ib Kauj Ruam Zuj Zus los yog Pob Tag Nrho. Kaw nws kom tawm hauv txheej txheem tsim zaj lus qhia.",
    "analysis_generate_button": "Kuaj koj cov ntawv qhov chaw rau koj ua xibfwb. Daim ntawv qhia muab qib nyeem kwv yees nrog laj thawj, cov tswv yim tseem ceeb, qhab nia qhov tseeb, teeb meem qauv lus los yog sau ntawv, hom lus qhov chaw, Qhov Tob Ntawm Kev Paub, thiab tej kev thaiv uas tej zaum muaj. Nws sau ua hom lus ntawm app. Tswv yim: khiav nws ua ntej los npaj kev pab.",
