    "export_worksheet": "Qhib ib daim ntawv ua haujlwm saib ua ntej uas tsim los rau tub ntxhais kawm sau rau saum. Kuaj cov chaw teb thiab cov qauv uas tub ntxhais kawm pom, ces siv Luam Tawm / Khaws ua PDF. Lub qhov rai luam tawm ntawm browser ua kom tiav kev luam tawm los yog khaws.",
