    "fab_dictation": "Hloov suab hais ua ntawv rau kev sau tsis siv tes. Nyem qhib microphone, hais kom meej, ces pom lo lus tshwm. Ua haujlwm hauv qhov sau ntawv, khoom pab sau, kev sib tham. Xav tau kev tso cai microphone. Tswv yim: Hais ua kab lus puv kom raug zoo dua.",
    "fab_focus": "Qhib Hom Nyeem Bionic, uas ua kom thawj feem ntawm txhua lo lus tuab dua kom lub qhov muag taug yooj yim. Qee tus pom tias pab; lwm tus pom tias cuam tshuam, yog li cia tub ntxhais kawm sim thiab xaiv. Nias dua los kaw.",
