    "scaffolds_student_input": "Qhov tub ntxhais kawm sau lo lus teb rau tus qauv no. Cia li khaws thaum sau. Yog muaj tsev khaws lo lus, nyem lo lus yuav ntxig rau ntawm no. Tswv yim: hais tswv yim nrov ua ntej ces mam sau.",
    "settings_close_btn": "Kaw lub vaj huam sib luag chaw teeb tsa. Koj cov kev hloov twb khaws cia lawm, yog li tsis muaj nas khawm Khaws. Tus yuam sij Escape kuj kaw lub vaj huam. Tsis muaj kev thim rov qab. Yog xav hloov ib yam rov qab, koj teeb tsa dua ntawm koj tus kheej.",
    "settings_free_response": "Control lo lus teb kev nkag hom globally. Free response ON: tub ntxhais kawm construct their own lo lus teb, higher cognitive demand, tsim sau ntawv thiab explanation kev txawj, requires ntau careful grading. Free response OFF: ntau kev xaiv only, faster kev ua tiav, auto-graded, lower anxiety rau sib tw tub ntxhais kawm. Consider purpose: formative kev ntsuam xyuas may benefit los ntawm free response mus pom thinking, summative may siv MCQ rau consistency. tuaj yeem be overridden per activity. Affects: kev sim, persona interactions, thiab scaffold kev ua tiav. Free response develops deeper understanding tab sis takes longer. cov lus qhia: Mix hom raws rau saum kev kawm objectives.",
