    "ws_gen_minimize": "Kaw me kev teeb tsa Suab Lo Lus ua daim npav me hauv qab sab xis thaum kev npaj tseem khiav. Kov Nthuav los rov qab.",
    "ws_gen_close": "Kaw kev teeb tsa Suab Lo Lus. Nres kev npaj lo lus yog tseem khiav. Rov qhib tau los ntawm khawm Suab Lo Lus.",
    "ws_gen_expand": "Rov nthuav kev teeb tsa Suab Lo Lus puv vijtsam. Khaws tag nrho kev teeb tsa thiab kev nce qib.",
    "ws_gen_ortho_slider": "Controls yuav ua li cas many spelling (orthography) activities yog suav nrog per kev sib ntsib. Slide sab xis mus ntxiv spelling xyaum after phonics activities ua kom tiav. thaum teeb mus 0 (Off), no spelling activities yog tau tsim. thaum controlled by zaj lus qhia Kev npaj hom, qhov no slider yog locked thiab managed automatically. Spelling activities reinforce sound-mus-letter mapping tub ntxhais kawm kawm during phonics, strengthening encoding kev txawj alongside decoding.",
    "ws_gen_review_btn": "Tshwm thaum npaj lo lus lawm. Qhib lub vaj huam sib luag kuaj xyuas saib txhua lo lus nrog nws cov suab thiab suab lus ua ntej pib zaj lus qhia.",
    "ws_gen_count_slider": "Teeb total tus lej ntawm lo lus hauv koj phonics zaj lus qhia. Range: 5 lo lus (ceev xyaum, ~5 minutes) mus 30 lo lus (comprehensive kev sib ntsib, ~25 minutes). Consider: attention span (younger = fewer lo lus), kev txawj theem (sib tw readers need ntau repetition ntawm fewer lo lus), kev sib ntsib type (intervention vs. enrichment). txhua lo lus muaj: suab pronunciation, phoneme breakdown, AI-tau tsim duab, thiab mus sib tham activities. ntau lo lus = ntau variety tab sis longer kev sib ntsib. Fewer lo lus = deeper xyaum nrog txhua. Rau RTI Tier 2/3 intervention, 8-12 lo lus nrog ntau repetitions yog typically recommended. Kho raws rau saum tub ntxhais kawm response.",
    "ws_gen_session_slider": "Define mastery threshold rau kev sib ntsib kev ua tiav. Range: 3 correct (ceev check) mus 20 correct (extended xyaum). txhua correct lo lus teb: advances kev nce qib bar, awards XP, thiab reinforces kev kawm. Incorrect lo lus teb: provide kev tawm tswv yim tab sis do tsis subtract los ntawm lub hom phiaj. kev sib ntsib ends thaum threshold yog met, rewarding persistence. Higher thresholds = ntau xyaum = stronger retention. Lower thresholds = quicker kev ua tiav = ntau kev sib ntsib possible. Rau sib tw readers, pib nrog achievable lub hom phiaj (5-8) mus tsim confidence. Rau fluent readers, higher lub hom phiaj maintain engagement. kev nce qib auto-khaws so tub ntxhais kawm tuaj yeem mus ntxiv later yog tias needed.",
    "ws_gen_theme_input": "Hloov raws siab nyiam kev pom hom rau cov lus duab. Sau hom descriptions like: pixel art (retro kev ua si look), watercolor (soft painterly), cartoon (bright kid-friendly), realistic photo (accurate qhov xa mus), los yog sketch (yooj yim kab drawings). hom applies mus tag nrho tau tsim lo lus duab. Leave blank rau default hom. hom affects engagement thiab appropriateness rau age. Qee hom work zoo dua rau certain cov ntsiab. kev sim mus find dab tsi resonates nrog koj tub ntxhais kawm. cov lus qhia: Siv cartoon los yog pixel art rau younger tub ntxhais kawm, realistic rau older grades studying science cov lus.",
    "ws_gen_syllable_min": "Teem tus naj npawb suab lus tsawg kawg (1 txog 12, tsis siab tshaj Ntau Tshaj). 1-suab lus rau CVC thiab pib nyeem; 2+ rau kev faib suab lus siab dua.",
    "ws_gen_syllable_max": "Teeb upper limit rau lo lus syllable suav. Ua hauj lwm nrog Minimum slider mus tsim ranges. piv txwv: Min 1, Max 2 tsim one thiab two syllable lo lus. Min 2, Max 4 tsim multisyllabic kev sib tw lo lus. Teeb ob qho sib npaug rau tshwj xeeb syllable xyaum. Higher maximums suav nrog: longer lo lus, ntau nyuaj decoding, thiab qib siab cov lus. Consider theem qib kawm: K-1 typically 1-2 syllables, 2-3 up mus 3 syllables, 4+ tuaj yeem handle 4+ syllables. Syllable suav affects activity duration. cov lus qhia: Gradually increase maximum as tub ntxhais kawm master current range.",
    "ws_gen_src_glossary": "Rub lo lus los ntawm koj phau ntawv qhia lus rau kev xyaum suab ntawv (10 lo lus thawj; siv Ntxiv tag nrho rau cov tshuav). Tau IPA, suab lus thiab suab hais.",
    "ws_gen_src_family": "Ntxiv ib daim ntawv teev lo lus npaj tseg rau zaj lus qhia (10 lo lus thawj hauv txhua daim, los ntawm tshuab tsis yog AI). Zoo rau cov pib nyeem ntawv.",
    "ws_gen_family_select": "Xaiv ib daim ntawv teev npaj tseg, ces nyem Ntxiv (tsev neeg suab sib phim, suab ob tug, suab sib xyaw, lo lus nquag pom, lo lus ntev). Txhua daim ntxiv 10 lo lus thawj.",
    "ws_gen_src_custom": "Tsim daim ntawv teev lo lus koj tus kheej. Qhib Kuv cov lo lus thiab sau los lo lo lus cais nrog qhov khoob los nkhaus. Tau IPA, suab lus, duab thiab kev ua puv npo.",
