    "wizard_url_source": "Muab tso web URL mus coj los cov ntsiab directly los ntawm internet. system yuav nqa phab ntawv cov ntsiab thiab siv it as qhov chaw material rau tab tom tsim zaj lus qhia kev pab cuam.",
    "wizard_search_source": "Nrhiav cov ntawv qhov chaw hauv internet: lo txuas vev xaib los piav lub ntsiab lus kom AI nrhiav. Kuaj ua ntej tsim khoom qhia rau tub ntxhais kawm.",
    "wizard_generate_source": "Tsim thawj zaj lus qhia cov ntsiab los ntawm scratch siv AI. Provide cov ncauj lus thiab system yuav tsim comprehensive qhov chaw material tailored mus koj theem qib kawm thiab tus qauv.",
    "bridge_mode_button": "Qhib Bridge hom mus sib koom cov ntsiab across tub ntxhais kawm devices during ncaj qha kev sib ntsib. Bridge hom enables: sending phau ntawv qhia lus lo lus, simplified cov ntawv, kev sim, thiab lwm tau tsim kev pab cuam directly mus connected tub ntxhais kawm devices. tub ntxhais kawm txais cov ntsiab instantly without needing mus navigate los yog configure anything. Siv qhov no rau sync whole-chav kawm activities, distributing differentiated cov khoom siv, thiab ensuring tag nrho tub ntxhais kawm muaj kev nkag mus tib yam kev pab cuam.",
    "dashboard_detail_games": "Comprehensive kev ua si performance cov ntsiab lus rau tau xaiv tub ntxhais kawm. Displays cov txiaj ntsig across tag nrho cov lus thiab cov ntsiab kev ua si suav nrog: Memory Match, lo lus-lub ntsiab Matching, Syntax Scramble, Crossword, Timeline, Lub tswv yim Muab cais, Venn duab piav qhia, Bingo, thiab lo lus Scramble. Rau txhua kev ua si played, qhia: tus lej ntawm plays, qhov tseeb/qhab nia, thiab performance trends. Siv qhov no cov ncauj lus mus txheeb xyuas which kev ua si-raws kev kawm activities yog most effective rau txhua tub ntxhais kawm thiab qhov twg additional xyaum may be needed.",
    "dashboard_detail_label_challenge": "Label kev sib tw cov txiaj ntsig rau tau xaiv tub ntxhais kawm qhia their performance hauv kev pom labeling activity. Displays: average qhab nia across tag nrho attempts, best qhab nia achieved, tus lej ntawm attempts, thiab tus kheej attempt cov txiaj ntsig nrog timestamps. Label kev sib tw kev xeem tub ntxhais kawm' ability mus correctly label parts ntawm AI-tau tsim duab piav qhia siv phau ntawv qhia lus cov lus. Siv qhov no mus assess cov lus knowledge hauv kev pom/spatial conntawv nyeem thiab track improvement tshaj time.",
    "dashboard_detail_socratic": "Scrollable transcript ntawm tau xaiv tub ntxhais kawm's Socratic Chatbot conversation history. Shows: total cov xov suav, ua kom tiav rov qab-thiab-forth dialogue nyob nruab nrab tub ntxhais kawm thiab AI tutor, thiab cov xov timestamps. tub ntxhais kawm cov xov tshwm sim rau saum sab xis (teal), AI responses rau saum left. Socratic Chatbot guides tub ntxhais kawm dhau los ntawm cov ntsiab kev nkag siab siv lus nuging techniques rather than direct lo lus teb. Review these transcripts mus: assess tub ntxhais kawm thinking processes, txheeb xyuas misconceptions, evaluate tob ntawm engagement, thiab inform differentiated cov lus qhia.",
    "dashboard_detail_word_sounds": "Suab Lus performance cov ncauj lus rau tau xaiv tub ntxhais kawm. Shows metrics los ntawm Suab Lus Studio phonics activities suav nrog: qhov tseeb feem pua, kev sib ntsib qhab nia, lo lus kev xyaumd, thiab activity kev ua tiav kev meej. cov ncauj lus comes los ntawm Break It Down (phoneme segmentation), Rhyme Time (rhyming identification), thiab Letter Tracing activities. Siv qhov no mus track phonemic awareness development thiab txheeb xyuas tshwj xeeb phonics kev txawj qhov ntawd need additional xyaum. pom tau only thaum tub ntxhais kawm has completed Suab Lus activities.",
    "dashboard_live_sync": "Connect mus ncaj qha chav kawm kev sib ntsib mus monitor tub ntxhais kawm kev nce qib hauv real time. Nyem mus sau kev sib ntsib code — tub ntxhais kawm hauv qhov ntawd kev sib ntsib yuav tshwm sim hauv koj dashboard nrog ncaj qha-updating cov ncauj lus (📡 lub cim). koj tuaj yeem pom their activity kev ua tiav, kev sim qhab nia, XP, fluency history, kev ua si performance, thiab safety flag summaries as they work. Nyem again while connected mus disconnect. Ncaj qha sync siv Firestore thiab requires internet connectivity. kev sib ntsib codes yog tau tsim thaum tub ntxhais kawm join kev sib ntsib. cov ncauj lus flows one-way los ntawm tub ntxhais kawm mus xib fwb rau privacy compliance. Only muaj hauv district-hosted deployments (tsis Canvas).",
    "dashboard_rti_monitor": "Tus kheej tub ntxhais kawm RTI kev nce qib monitoring phab ntsa qhia meej intervention cov ncauj lus. Displays: current tier assignment nrog xim-coded lub cim (Tier 1/2/3), hoob kawmification reasoning, tshwj xeeb performance metrics (kev sim qhab nia, fluency, activity kev ua tiav), sparkline trend chart rau fluency thiab kev ua si qhab nia tshaj time, thiab actionable recommendations. xib fwb tuaj yeem siv Configure pob nias mus kho tier thresholds. Qhov no cov ncauj lus kev txhawb IEP documentation thiab cov ncauj lus-driven instructional decisions. Metrics hloov tshiab thaum tshiab tub ntxhais kawm cov ncauj lus yog imported los yog synced ncaj qha.",
    "dashboard_rti_summary": "chav kawm-theem RTI (Response mus Intervention) overview qhia distribution ntawm tub ntxhais kawm across intervention tiers. Displays: Tier 1 (green, rau saum track), Tier 2 (yellow, needs monitoring), thiab Tier 3 (red, intensive kev txhawb needed) counts nrog kev pom lub cim. txhua tier qhia tub ntxhais kawm suav thiab feem pua. cov ntsiab lus also muaj donut-hom visualization ntawm tier distribution. Siv qhov no mus quickly txheeb xyuas yuav ua li cas many tub ntxhais kawm need additional kev txhawb thiab mus track chav kawm-wide trends tshaj time. Tier assignments yog calculated automatically los ntawm kev sim qhab nia, kev ua si performance, activity kev ua tiav, thiab fluency cov ncauj lus.",
    "dashboard_safety_toggle": "Hloov visibility ntawm safety flag cov ncauj lus hauv xib fwb dashboard. thaum ON (default): Safety Flags kem tshwm hauv tub ntxhais kawm lub rooj qhia flag counts thiab critical alerts (🚨). thaum OFF: kem yog hidden rau cleaner saib. Important: qhov no hloov only controls tso tawm — safety flags yog ALWAYS collected silently hauv background regardless ntawm qhov no kev teeb tsa. AI-powered safety checks khiav rau saum every tub ntxhais kawm cov xov hauv Socratic kev sib tham, Persona Interviews, thiab Kev mus ncig hom. Hloov state yog tau khaws mus localStorage thiab persists across kev sib ntsib. Siv qhov no mus reduce kev pom clutter thaum safety monitoring yog tsis koj current focus.",
    "roster_manage_button": "Qhib lub vaj huam sib luag daim ntawv teev npe chav kawm. Tis npe chav kawm, tsim pawg nrog qib kawm, qib nyeem, hom lus, DOK, TTS, ntxiv tub ntxhais kawm nrog npe zais, thiab sib txuas rau kev sib tham ncaj qha. Xa tawm/nqa nkag ua JSON tau.",
