    "visuals_layout_mode": "Xaiv yuav ua li cas AI-tau tsim duab yog arranged rau saum phab ntawv. Layout hom suav nrog: AI Art Director (auto) — AI analyzes cov ntsiab thiab automatically xaiv most appropriate layout; Single duab — one focused illustration; Before & After — two duab qhia hloov los yog contrast; Comparison — side-by-side duab rau comparing lub tswv yim; Sequence/cov theem — numbered duab qhia process los yog timeline; Labeled duab piav qhia — annotated duab nrog cov ntawv labels pointing mus key parts. AI Art Director hom siv koj cov ntsiab conntawv nyeem mus intelligently xaiv best layout without siv tes configuration.",
