    "tool_anchor_chart": "Tsim ib daim ntawv txheeb rau chav kawm nrog thawj daim ntawv uas twb sau tseg lawm thiab cov cim zoo li kos tes. Xaiv Txhua-Txhua, lossis xaiv seb daim ntawv siv rau dab tsi: Txheeb Xyuas, Txheej Txheem, Daim Duab Tswv Yim, Kev Sib Piv, Tswv Yim, Cov Lus, Kev Ua Niaj Hnub, Piv Txwv Daws Tau, Cov Qauv Ua Tau Zoo, Kev Nkag Siab Yuam Kev, lossis Phau Qhia Lus Nug. Koj kho tau daim ntawv thiab luam loj ua ntawv txhuam phab ntsa.",
    "anchor_chart_type": "Xaiv cov qauv daim ntawv uas haum rau qhov cov tub ntxhais kawm xav tau los ntawm cov ntaub ntawv. Auto cia AlloFlow xaiv. Reference zoo tshaj rau cov yam ntxwv, cov cai, lossis cov kev cog lus. Process thiab Routine zoo tshaj rau cov kauj ruam ua raws. Concept Map zoo tshaj rau cov ntu ntawm ib qho tag nrho. Comparison zoo tshaj rau kev sib piv ib sab ib sab. Strategy, Vocabulary, Worked Example, Success Criteria, Misconceptions, thiab Question Guide tsim cov ntaub ntawv qhia hauv chav kawm uas taw tau raws sij hawm yam tsis ntxiv lwm txoj hauj lwm rau tub ntxhais kawm.",
    "anchor_chart_generate_button": "Tsim ib daim ntawv txheeb los ntawm hnub no cov ntawv nyeem. AI sau lub npe, cov npe ntu, cov ntsiab, lub hom phiaj ntawm kev teeb tsa, thiab cov lus qhia ua cov cim zoo li kos tes. Cov tawm tuaj kho tau tam sim ntawd: hloov cov ntawv, rub kom rov teeb cov ntu, ntxiv lossis tshem cov ntu, thiab rov tsim cov cim. Siv Interactive Mode thaum koj xav kom cov tub ntxhais kawm sau lawv tus kheej cov lus teb thiab tau lus teb rov qab xwb; yog tsis li ntawd daim ntawv tseem yog ib daim ntaub ntawv huv luam tau.",
    "tool_dbq": "Tsim ib txoj hauj lwm Document-Based Question ntawm tsib txoj kev. Standard rub cov ntaub ntawv los ntawm koj cov ntawv nyeem. Competing Perspectives nrhiav ob sab lossis ntau sab uas tsis pom zoo. Web-Enhanced coj cov chaw tiag los ntawm cov chaw xws li Library of Congress. Teacher Links tsim txoj hauj lwm ib puag ncig cov kev sib txuas koj muab tso rau. Teacher Docs siv cov ntawv koj tus kheej muab tso rau. Txhua txoj kev muab tib pawg rau koj: cov ntu ntaub ntawv, ib daim qauv HAPP los tshuaj xyuas qhov chaw, ib daim ntawv sib piv cov ntaub ntawv, ib lub ntsiab sau ntawv, thiab ib daim ntawv ntsuas 4 ntsiab.",
    "dbq_generate_button": "Tsim ib pob DBQ siv hom koj xaiv. Koj tau cov feem ntaub ntawv (kwv yees 3 rau qib qis, 4 rau qib nruab nrab, 5-6 rau qib siab) nrog lus qhia HAPP thiab lus nug, kev sib piv pov thawj, lub ntsiab sau ntawv thiab qauv ntsuas qhab nia 4-qib. Tswv yim: kho cov qauv ntsuas qhab nia ua ntej muab haujlwm.",
    "header_educator_hub": "Qhib Cov Cuab Yeej Rau Xibfwb, lub chaw rau xibfwb cov haujlwm sab nraud ib zaj lus qhia. Muaj Chaw Tsim Cim Duab, BehaviorLens, Tus Sau Ntawv Qhia, Lub Chaw Ntsuam Xyuas, Kev Ntsuam Xyuas Hloov Raws, Kev Xaiv Tsa & Sau Npe, Kev Nkag Tau PDF thiab Chaw Sib Txuas Lus. Nias hnub qub ntxiv rau cov uas nyiam.",
    "header_open_notebook": "Qhib Kuv Phau Ntawv Sau. Nws khaws cov nplooj sau ntawv thiab cov ntawv txheeb koj khaws cia, tshiab tshaj ua ntej. Cov pob saum toj cia koj qhia ib hom xwb, xws li Cornell Notes lossis Lab Reports. Kais ib nplooj kom qhib nws dua. Koj luam tau lawv tag nrho ib zaug. Yog koj khaws ob nplooj sau ntawv lossis ntau dua, AlloFlow nyeem tau txhua nplooj thiab taw tau cov qauv rov ua dua. Lub pob no tshwm tuaj thaum koj twb khaws ib yam dab tsi lawm xwb.",
