    "schoolrewards_status": "Qhia seb puas khaws qhov chaw Khw ntawm lub cuab yeej no. Qhov no tsis yog kev sim txuas.",
    "schoolrewards_step_approval": "Lees paub kev pom zoo ntawm tsev kawm ntawv uas xav tau ua ntej teeb tsa Khw.",
