    "what_is_udl": "dab tsi yog UDL?",
    "udl_definition": "Universal Design for Learning (UDL) yog ib lub moj khaum los txhim kho thiab ua kom kev qhia thiab kev kawm zoo tshaj plaws rau txhua tus neeg, raws li kev tshawb fawb txog yuav ua li cas tib neeg kawm.",
