    "atlas_title": "AlloFlow Atlas",
    "privacy_title": "Kev ceev ntiag tug thiab cov ntaub ntawv tub kawm",
    "privacy_intro": "AlloFlow tsim rau kev siv hauv chav kawm uas saib xyuas kev ceev ntiag tug. Qhov chaw uas cov ntaub ntawv nyob yog nyob ntawm qhov chaw khaws ntaub ntawv, txoj kev xa kev sib ntsib, thiab tus muab AI uas koj xaiv; daim duab qhia no pab koj lub tsev kawm ntawv tshuaj xyuas txhua txoj kev.",
    "privacy_footer": "Nov yog cov lus piav qhia khoom siv lus yooj yim, tsis yog kev qhia cai lossis daim ntawv pov thawj. Koj lub koom haum yog tus saib xyuas FERPA, kev ceev ntiag tug, kev pom zoo, kev khaws thiab kev rho tawm.",
    "a11y_intro": "Kev nkag mus tau tsis yog ib yam ntxwv xwb ntawm no — nws yog lub hom phiaj tag nrho. AlloFlow tsim kom ze rau WCAG 2.2 AA (ib lub hom phiaj, tsis yog daim ntawv pov thawj). Muaj kev kuaj axe-core thiab IBM Equal Access cia li hauv cov chaw siv thiab cov txheej txheem ntaub ntawv uas cuam tshuam. Txoj kev PDF tuaj yeem khiav veraPDF kev txheeb xyuas raws li PDF/UA-1 (ISO 14289-1); AlloFlow tsis lees paub kev ua raws li yog tias cov kev kuaj uas muaj tsis txhawb nqa.",
    "a11y_footer": "Pom ib qho teeb meem? Qhia peb — teeb meem kev siv tau yuav tau ua ntej.",
    "oss_credits_title": "Tsim los ntawm qhov chaws qhib",
    "oss_credits_intro": "AlloFlow yog dawb thiab qhib qhov chaws (AGPL-3.0), tsim los ntawm cov haujlwm hauv qab no. Ua tsaug rau lawv cov neeg sau thiab zej zog.",
    "oss_featured_header": "Cov cuab yeej kawm uas peb txuas",
    "oss_full_list_header": "Cov tsev qiv ntawv thiab cov peev txheej qhib uas peb txuas",
    "media_guardrails_intro": "Video Studio tuaj yeem taug qab daim ntawv qhuas txog cov duab thiab xov xwm pub dawb hauv txhua qhov dej num. Peb tsis suav tias txhua lub vev xaib duab pub dawb yog qhib pub siv: txhua daim ntaub ntawv yuav tsum muaj nws daim ntawv tso cai, qhov URL keeb kwm, thiab ntaub ntawv teev lub npe tus tswv ua ntej muab qhia.",
    "media_guardrails_title": "Txoj cai tiv thaiv cov duab thiab xov xwm qhib/pub dawb",
    "maker": "Tsim los ntawm Dr. Aaron Pomeranz, ib tug kws kev puas siab puas ntsws hauv tsev kawm ntawv nyob Portland, Maine.",
    "dedication": "Rau kuv txiv, Dr. Robert Pomeranz: ib tug xib fwb, ib tug kws kho mob, thiab ib tug neeg nyiam dab neeg txog kev tshawb fawb thiab yav tom ntej kawg li. Nws teem siab kho lub ntiaj teb kom zoo, thiab raws li nws txoj kev, nws ua tau tiav lawm.",
    "oss_website": "Lub vev xaib",
