    "oss_reading_body": "Cov ntawv nyeem thiab lawv cov ntaub ntawv teev npe tsis nyob hauv AlloFlow daim ntawv tso cai AGPL. Txhua phau ntawv nyeem tau khaws nws cov neeg sau, tus luam tawm, txoj txuas mus rau qhov chaw los, daim ntawv tso cai tseeb rau phau ntawd, thiab cov kev txwv uas siv rau nws. Cov pawg ntawv uas cov cai sib xyaw los yog tsis meej tsuas muab txoj txuas xwb, mus txog thaum kev kuaj xyuas txhua phau pom zoo ntxiv.",
    "oss_reading_toggle": "Saib cov chaw muab ntawv nyeem uas peb lees paub ({count})",
    "oss_rights": "Cov cai:",
