    "atlas_empty_hint": "Sim ib lub ntsiab lus dav dua, lub hom phiaj, los yog lub npe cuab yeej.",
    "clear_search": "Tshem kev nrhiav",
    "atlas_note": "Cov lej yog cov yam hauv txhua phau npe, thiab muaj ob peb qho cuab yeej nyob hauv ntau tshaj ib lub chaw. Chav Kuaj STEAM, SEL Chaw, thiab Chaw Tshawb Fawb nyeem los ntawm app nws cov phau npe; lwm lub chaw yog neeg xaiv los ntawm tes.",
    "privacy_saved_title": "Cov haujlwm uas khaws tseg",
    "privacy_saved_body": "Cov zaj kawm, kev teeb tsa, thiab cov haujlwm raug khaws hauv lub browser no ntawm lub tshuab no. Yog koj qhib cloud sync, nws kuj khaws lawv rau ntawd thiab. Hauv Gemini Canvas los yog lub qhov rais ntiag tug (private window), qhov chaw khaws hauv browser tej zaum yuav tsis nyob ntev, yog li rub ib daim file project los khaws ib daim qauv.",
    "privacy_sessions_title": "Kev kawm hauv chav thiab cov haujlwm xa tuaj",
    "privacy_sessions_body": "Cov ntaub ntawv ntawm kev kawm hauv chav mus qhov twg nyob ntawm txoj kev txuas uas koj xaiv. Desktop LAN thiab local preview khaws cov ntaub ntawv xa mus los nyob ntawm lub khoos phis tawj no los yog koj lub network hauv zos. Bring-your-own Firebase siv koj lub tsev kawm ntawv los yog koog tsev kawm ntawv tus kheej Firebase project. Class Mailbox xa cov pob ntawv thiab cov haujlwm dhau ntawm tus xib fwb tus kheej Apps Script, thiab khaws cov haujlwm hauv tus xib fwb li Google Drive mus txog thaum tus xib fwb rho lawv tawm. Hauv Gemini Canvas, kev kawm siv qhov chaw khaws uas Google muab rau Canvas apps. Lub server ntawm koog tsev kawm ntawv tsuas siv thaum koj lub koog tsev kawm ntawv tau teeb tsa ib lub xwb.",
    "privacy_ai_title": "AI",
    "privacy_ai_body": "Cov AI hauv zos khiav ntawm lub tshuab no thaum rub lawv cov model los lawm. Cov AI online (Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, los yog ib qho endpoint uas siv tau nrog OpenAI) tau txais cov lus txib thiab tsuas yog cov ntawv, duab, los yog suab uas ib qho cuab yeej xav tau xwb, raws li tus muab kev pab ntawd cov cai, kev khaws cia, thiab cov cai txog hnub nyoog. Google cov cai rau Gemini API hais tias cov neeg siv yuav tsum muaj 18 xyoos los yog laus dua, yog li hom tub ntxhais kawm tsis siv tus yuam sij (key) Gemini uas muab paste rau ntawm lub tshuab no, thiab tub ntxhais kawm siv tau lawv tus kheej tus yuam sij tsuas yog tom qab ib tug xib fwb lees paub tias lawv yog neeg laus lawm xwb.",
    "privacy_speech_title": "Suab hais lus thiab cov suab nyeem",
    "privacy_speech_body": "Hloov suab ua ntawv: ib qho model ntawm lub tshuab, los yog lub desktop app, khaws koj lub suab nyob ntawm lub tshuab no. Lub browser txoj kev pab hais lus tej zaum yuav xa koj lub suab mus rau lub tuam txhab ua browser (hauv Chrome, yog Google); xaiv lub cav hauv Kev Teeb Tsa Suab. Nyeem nrov: cov suab ntawm lub tshuab, xws li pob suab Kokoro, nyob ntawm lub tshuab no, tiam sis qee lub suab hauv browser yog kev pab online.",
    "privacy_reports_title": "Kev qhia txog teeb meem",
    "privacy_reports_body": "Daim ntawv qhia teeb meem tsuas xa thaum koj xaiv xa nws xwb. Ua ntej xa, app tshem cov yuam sij (key) thiab cov ntaub ntawv tus kheej uas pom ntau, xws li email thiab tus xov tooj. Cov ntawv qhia mus rau AlloFlow lub thawv txais ntawv ntiag tug thiab raug rho tawm tom qab 30 hnub.",
    "privacy_paths_heading": "Cov ntaub ntawv mus tau qhov twg",
    "privacy_choose_heading": "Ua tib zoo xaiv txoj kev rau cov ntaub ntawv",
    "privacy_local_title": "Kom khiav hauv zos tag nrho",
    "privacy_local_body": "Xaiv ib lub AI hauv zos, kev hais lus ntawm lub tshuab, thiab ib qho kev kawm Desktop LAN los yog local preview. Rub cov model kom tiav ua ntej koj tsis siv internet, thiab tso kev nrhiav hauv web, cloud sync, cov media online, thiab cloud AI kaw cia.",
    "privacy_hosted_title": "Thaum siv cov kev pab online",
    "privacy_hosted_body": "Siv ib tus account, endpoint, project, thiab daim ntawv cog lus txog kev siv cov ntaub ntawv uas koj lub koom haum pom zoo, qhov twg yuav tsum muaj. Tsuas them nyiaj rau ib txoj kev npaj xwb tsis tau txhais tias lub tsev kawm ntawv pom zoo los yog raws li txoj cai lawm.",
    "privacy_checklist_heading": "Ua ntej siv cov ntaub ntawv ntawm tub ntxhais kawm",
    "privacy_check_1": "Qhib Kev Teeb Tsa AI thiab saib seb tus muab kev pab thiab endpoint twg tab tom siv: hauv zos los yog online.",
    "privacy_check_2": "Qhib kev teeb tsa kev kawm hauv chav thiab saib txoj kev xa, qhov chaw khaws, kev tswj leej twg nkag tau, thiab txoj kev rho tawm/khaws cia.",
    "privacy_check_3": "Qhib Kev Teeb Tsa Suab thiab xaiv seb suab hais yuav hloov ua ntawv li cas.",
    "privacy_check_4": "Nrog koj tus saib xyuas kev ceev ntiag tug los yog IT, lees paub tias lub koom haum pom zoo, tus muab kev pab cov kev txwv txog hnub nyoog/kev siv, thiab cov ntawv cog lus uas siv rau koj.",
    "privacy_check_5": "Siv cov npe thiab lwm yam qhia tau tias yog leej twg kom tsawg li tsawg tau, ces tshuaj xyuas cov ntawv uas tsim tawm ua ntej muab qhia.",
    "privacy_link_gemini_terms": "Gemini API cov cai",
    "privacy_link_gemini_edu": "Gemini rau Kev Kawm",
    "privacy_link_openai": "OpenAI API kev tswj cov ntaub ntawv",
    "privacy_link_anthropic": "Anthropic lub chaw qhia txog kev ceev ntiag tug",
    "privacy_commitments_heading": "AlloFlow cov lus cog tseg",
    "privacy_commit_1": "AlloFlow tsis muag cov ntaub ntawv, tsis qhia kev tshaj tawm (ads), thiab tsis tsim cov profile rau kev tshaj tawm, thiab nws tsis ntxiv cov script ntsuas kev tshaj tawm los yog tsim profile.",
    "privacy_commit_2": "Tsis tas muaj ib lub npe siv thiab lo lus zais AlloFlow txawv rau cov cuab yeej tseem ceeb; ib txoj kev xa kev kawm uas koj xaiv tau tej zaum yuav tsim cov ntaub ntawv nkag (credentials) ib ntus rau kev ua haujlwm.",
    "privacy_commit_3": "AlloFlow tsis khiav ib lub cloud service ntawm nws tus kheej rau kev kawm hauv chav. Cov tsev kawm ntawv thiab koog tsev kawm ntawv uas xav tau ib lub teeb tsa lawv tus kheej.",
    "privacy_commit_4": "Cov file ntawm app los ntawm AlloFlow lub vev xaib, thiab qee qhov xa tawm rub cov font los ntawm Google Fonts. Ib yam li txhua lub vev xaib, cov server ntawd pom koj lub tshuab tus IP address.",
    "privacy_commit_5": "Lwm lub tuam txhab tej zaum yuav khaws cov ntawv sau txog kev ua haujlwm los yog kev tiv thaiv kev siv tsis zoo raws li lawv tus kheej cov cai, yog li nyeem cov cai tam sim no rau txhua qhov kev pab uas koj qhib.",
