      "per_grade_skills_checklists_use_during": "Cov checklist txuj ci raws qib. Siv thaum kev ntsuas ib leeg rau ib leeg lossis los npaj kev qhia.",
      "my_child_says_i_hate_fractions": "Kuv tus menyuam hais «Kuv ntxub cov feem»",
      "very_common_fractions_break_the_rules_": "Nquag heev. Cov feem rhuav cov cai uas cov tub ntxhais kawm kawm rau cov lej tag — cov lej loj dua tsis ib txwm txhais tias tus nqi loj dua. Kev nyuaj siab yog tiag thiab qhov ib txwm. Pab los ntawm: (1) siv cov qauv duab xws li pizza lossis kab feem, (2) txuas nrog lub neej tiag (ua noj, sijhawm, nyiaj), (3) xyaum me me tiamsis nquag (5 min ib hnub) tsis yog cov session ntev, (4) qhuas kev siv zog, tsis yog cov lus teb yog xwb.",
      "my_child_doesn_t_understand_why_proced": "Kuv tus menyuam tsis nkag siab VIM LI CAS cov procedure ua haujlwm",
      "they_are_not_alone_most_students_learn": "Lawv tsis nyob ib leeg — feem ntau cov tub ntxhais kawm kawm cov procedure ua ntej thiab tom qab mam paub vim li cas. Pab los ntawm ib txwm qhia seb cov procedure zoo li cas nrog ib daim duab. «Sib npaug 3/4 nrog 1/2» tuaj yeem kos ua ib plaub fab. Lub tab Op Proofs ua qhov no rau koj. Nug «vim li cas?» maj mam thiab nquag.",
      "how_can_i_help_with_homework_without_d": "Kuv yuav pab homework li cas yam tsis ua nws rau lawv?",
      "use_the_worked_examples_tab_they_show_": "Siv lub tab Worked Examples — lawv qhia cov procedure ib kauj ruam zuj zus nrog kev xav. Hla cov teeb meem zoo sib xws ua ke, tsis yog tib qho. Yog lawv hais «Kuv tsis paub pib li cas», nug «Teeb meem thov kom nrhiav dab tsi? Peb twb paub dab tsi lawm?» Lub hint system hauv Word Problems muab cov hint ua txheej — sim thawj qhov ua ntej lus teb.",
      "what_should_i_drill": "Kuv yuav tsum drill dab tsi?",
      "ies_practice_guide_recommends_1_magnit": "IES Practice Guide pom zoo: (1) kev xav txog qhov loj (kab lej haujlwm), (2) kev txuas ntawm duab thiab symbolic, (3) cov teeb meem lus hauv ntsiab. ZAM: drill rau cov procedure yam tsis nkag siab. Siv 5 feeb rau Benchmark Trainer, 5 rau Word Problems, thiab 5 rau ib qho kev ua si — qhov ntawd yog ib qho session 15 feeb zoo.",
      "my_child_gets_the_procedure_right_but_": "Kuv tus menyuam ua cov procedure raug tiamsis lus teb yuam kev",
      "usually_means_a_small_arithmetic_error": "Feem ntau txhais tias ib qho yuam kev suav me (piv txwv, sib npaug yuam) lossis tsis tau ua yooj yim. Qhia lawv Cheat Sheet — lawv xyuas lawv txoj haujlwm ib kauj ruam zuj zus. Txhawb lawv los xyuas nrog lwm txoj kev (kwvyees ua ntej, lossis siv lwm qauv).",
      "what_if_i_don_t_remember_fractions_wel": "Yuav ua li cas yog kuv tus kheej tsis nco cov feem zoo?",
      "you_don_t_have_to_be_the_expert_use_th": "Koj tsis tas yuav ua tus kws paub! Siv Tab Guide thiab Worked Examples — lawv piav cov procedure meej. Zoo dua: ua qauv «cia peb daws qhov no ua ke». Koj kawm ua ke nrog koj tus menyuam. Lub tab Vocabulary muaj txiaj ntsig txawm rau cov neeg laus.",
      "how_do_i_know_if_my_child_is_on_track": "Kuv yuav paub li cas yog kuv tus menyuam nyob rau txoj kev raug?",
      "look_at_the_standards_tab_to_see_which": "Saib lub tab Standards los pom seb cov CCSS standard twg uas lawv yuav tsum paub rau lawv qib. Lub tab Mastery qhia kev vam meej. Rau kev xyuas sai: lawv puas tuaj yeem (a) kos ib qauv rau 3/4, (b) hais ib feem sib npaug rau 1/2, (c) sib piv 2/3 thiab 3/4 thiab piav? Peb qhov test ntawd them feem ntau kev cia siab feem hauv K-5.",
      "parent_guide": "👨‍👩‍👧 Phau qhia niam txiv",
      "guidance_for_parents_helping_kids_with": "Kev qhia rau niam txiv pab cov menyuam nrog cov feem hauv tsev. Cov teeb meem nquag, cov lus qhia siv tau, thiab yuav nug dab tsi.",
