      "migration_timing_varies_dramatically_b": "Lub sijhawm tsiv sib txawv heev raws li hom noog:",
      "early_spring_waterfowl_ducks_geese_hea": "Early spring: cov noog dej (os, os) mus rau sab qaum teb raws li kev yaj ntawm dej khov. Red-winged Blackbirds rov qab mus rau cov pas dej.",
      "peak_spring_warblers_vireos_tanagers_f": "Peak spring: cov warbler, vireo, thiab tanager puv sab qaum teb. Feem ntau cov songbird tsiv thaum hmo ntuj. Nyob rau hmo peak, muaj ntau dua 500 lab tus noog nyob saum huab cua.",
      "shorebirds_start_south_some_species_fa": "Cov shorebird pib mus sab qab teb — qee hom «swb» ntawm cov chaw yug thiab pib rov qab thaum ntxov Lub Xya Hli. Cov laus feem ntau ncaim ua ntej cov me nyuam.",
      "peak_fall_raptors_ride_thermals_along_": "Peak fall: cov raptor caij cov thermal raws li cov roob. Cov songbird raws cov cold front mus sab qab teb. Cov os ya hauv V formation thaum hmo ntuj.",
      "photoperiod_day_length_is_the_primary_": "Photoperiod (qhov ntev ntawm hnub) yog qhov trigger tseem ceeb ntawm kev tsiv. Thaum cov hnub luv dua thaum caij nplooj zeeg, cov hormone trigger «Zugunruhe» — kev tsis so ntawm kev tsiv — thiab cov noog pib khaws roj reserve (hyperphagia), qee zaus ntxiv lub cev qhov hnyav ob npaug.",
      "stopover_ecology": "⛺ Stopover ecology",
      "stopovers_are_not_just_rest_stops_they": "Cov stopover tsis yog cov chaw so xwb, lawv yog ",
      "refueling_stations": "cov refueling station",
      "critical_to_survival_a_migrating_warbl": " uas tseem ceeb rau kev ciaj sia. Ib tug warbler migrating yuav siv 75% ntawm lub sijhawm tsiv ntawm cov stopover, noj mov vwm los tsim roj reserve dua. Ib lub habitat stopover zoo yuav yog qhov txawv ntawm txoj sia thiab kev tuag.",
      "at_delaware_bay_over_1_million_shorebi": "Ntawm Delaware Bay, ntau dua 1 lab tus shorebird (Red Knots, Ruddy Turnstones, Sanderlings) vam khom rau cov qe horseshoe crab uas nteg thaum Lub Tsib Hlis. Lub sijhawm yuav tsum meej: cov noog tuaj txog raws nraim thaum cov horseshoe crab nteg qe. Yog cov horseshoe crab population poob (vim overfishing rau bait), tag nrho cov migration chain pob.",
      "conservation_success_story_after_horse": "Conservation success story: tom qab tsim cov horseshoe crab harvest limit xyoo 2012, cov Red Knot population pib rov qab qeeb qeeb los ntawm qhov qis tshaj critical 15,000 mus rau ntau dua 50,000 los ntawm 2025.",
      "migration_physiology": "🦴 Migration physiology",
      "migration_is_one_of_the_most_physicall": "Kev tsiv yog ib qho ntawm cov haujlwm physically demanding tshaj plaws hauv lub tebchaws tsiaj. Cov noog dhau cov physiological transformation zoo kawg ua ntej ncaim:",
      "hyperphagia": "Hyperphagia",
      "before_migration_birds_enter_a_feeding": "Ua ntej tsiv, cov noog nkag mus rau kev noj mov vwm hu ua hyperphagia, noj mov ntawm tus nqi 2-3x ntawm ib txwm. Blackpoll Warbler (12 g) ntxiv 8-12 g ntawm roj reserve, yuav luag ua rau lub cev qhov hnyav ob npaug. Cov roj no yog fuel rau cov flight tsis nres ntau dua 2,000 mais.",
      "organ_shrinkage": "Organ shrinkage",
      "to_reduce_weight_migrating_birds_actua": "Los txo qhov hnyav, cov noog migrating tiag tiag shrink cov digestive organ (hnyuv, siab, gizzard) txog li 40% ua ntej ncaim. Thaum tuaj txog ntawm cov stopover, lawv rov tsim cov organ no sai los refuel. Qhov «phenotypic plasticity» no yog qhov tshwj xeeb hauv cov vertebrate.",
      "hemoglobin": "Hemoglobin",
      "high_altitude_migrants_like_bar_headed": "Cov noog tsiv siab zoo li Bar-headed Geese (taug nrog satellite hla Himalayas siab txog kwv yees 24,000 ft) muaj hemoglobin tshwj xeeb uas ntes oxygen zoo dua. Lawv cov nqaij muaj myoglobin ntxiv, thiab cov hlab ntsha me ntau ob npaug ntawm cov noog nyob tiaj.",
      "sleep_in_flight": "Pw tsaug zog thaum ya",
      "some_birds_can_sleep_while_flying_usin": "Qee cov noog tuaj yeem pw tsaug zog thaum ya, siv «hemispheric sleep» — kaw ib nrab ntawm lub hlwb ib zaug. Cov frigatebird raug sau tias pw 42 feeb ib hnub thaum lub sijhawm 10-hnub transoceanic flight, ua micro-sleep 12 seconds ib zaug.",
      "navigation_clock": "Navigation clock",
      "birds_maintain_an_internal_circadian_c": "Cov noog tuav ib lub internal circadian clock nrog qhov precision zoo kawg. Lub clock no compensate rau lub hnub qhov txav thoob ntuj (time-compensated sun compass) thiab taug qab cov seasonal change ntawm qhov ntev ntawm hnub uas trigger cov migration hormone.",
      "zugunruhe": "Zugunruhe",
      "zugunruhe_migration_restlessness_is_a_": "Zugunruhe («kev tsis so ntawm kev tsiv») yog ib qho behavioral state uas cov noog migratory uas raug kaw hauv lub tawb flutter mus rau qhov kev taw uas lawv yuav tsiv raws li ntuj, nyob rau lub sijhawm uas lawv yuav tsiv. Nws tau tsav los ntawm hormone thiab coded genetically. Txawm cov noog uas tau tu los ntawm tes, tsis muaj migration experience, tseem qhia Zugunruhe.",
