      "distances_are_approximate_annual_migra": "Cov kev deb yog kev tsiv teb chaws txhua xyoo kwv yees. Qhov ceev yog qhov ceev ya qub. Qhov siab yog qhov siab tsiv qub. Qhov hnyav yog lub cev hnyav qub: ntau hom no khaws rog yuav luag ob npaug ua ntej tawm, uas yog qhov pab them rau kev ya deb.",
