      "inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a": "Cuab yeej tshawb fawb — tsis muaj qhab nia, tsis qhia lus teb. Tus qauv zog no yog piv txwv tab sis muaj duab yog: tus nqi rau ib km yog induced drag (∝ hnyav²/ntev tis², tus nqi tuav hnyav saum tis txwv) ntxiv profile thiab parasite drag (∝ hnyav^⅔), faib los ntawm feem ceev cua uas tus noog khaws ua ceev av. Peev txheej rog yog 30% ntawm cev hnyav ntawm 39 kJ/g. Nws raug kho kom muab lus teb tsim nyog rau cov noog loj npaum hauv lub cuab yeej no, thiab nws kwv yees tsawg dhau rau noog me heev, uas tis ua haujlwm tsis zoo npaum. Kev txuag zog ya duab V sib txawv ~10–30% hla ntau hom thiab chaw (Lissaman & Shollenberger 1970; kev ntsuas thaum ya suav nrog Weimerskirch et al. 2001 thiab Portugal et al. 2014); lub cuab yeej no siv 22% ua qhov nruab nrab txhua qhov. Rau kev kawm chaw so tiag saib cov ntaub ntawv tshawb fawb thawj.",
