      "migration_routes_flyways": "Migration routes + flyways",
      "four_major_north_american_flyways_paci": "Plaub lub North American flyway loj (Pacific, Central, Mississippi, Atlantic) coj billions tus noog ob zaug ib xyoos. Maine nyob ntawm sab saum toj ntawm Atlantic Flyway.",
      "aerodynamics_of_bird_flight": "Aerodynamics ntawm bird flight",
      "wing_shape_aspect_ratio_camber_tunes_l": "Duab tis (qhov piv ntev-dav + khoov tis) kho lub zog nqa piv rau cua tiv. Noog ya ntab = tis ntev siab, npuaj tis qeeb. Hummingbirds = AR qis, npuaj tis 50–80 Hz.",
