      "barry_harris_1929_2021_codified_bebop_": "Barry Harris (1929-2021) tau tsim cov cai rau bebop harmony. Nws txoj kev siv 6th chords es tsis yog 7ths thiab ntxiv diminished passing chords ntawm cov scale degrees kom lub suab mus tau du.",
