      "attack_time_to_reach_full_volume_decay": "Attack: lub sijhawm mus txog full volume. Decay: lub sijhawm poob mus rau sustain. Sustain: theem volume uas tuav. Release: lub sijhawm ploj mus tom qab tso lub key.",
      "a_scale_is_an_ordered_set_of_pitches_m": "Scale yog ib pawg pitch uas teeb raws qib. Cov mode yog cov kev tig ntawm scale uas pib ntawm cov degree sib txawv. Txhua qho tsim ib lub siab xav (mood) txawv.",
      "chords_are_built_by_stacking_intervals": "Cov chords raug tsim los ntawm kev tsub cov intervals (3rds). Major siv ib qho major 3rd + minor 3rd. Minor rov qab lawv. Extended chords ntxiv 7ths, 9ths, thiab ntau dua.",
      "kicks_use_a_sine_oscillator_with_a_pit": "Cov kick siv ib lub sine oscillator uas muaj pitch sweep. Cov snare sib xyaw suab nrov (filtered) + lub suab tone. Cov hi-hat siv suab nrov luv luv uas dhau high-pass filter.",
      "4_4_4_quarter_note_beats_per_bar_most_": "4/4 = 4 quarter-note beats hauv ib bar (feem ntau tshaj). 3/4 = waltz feel. 6/8 = compound duple. 5/4 thiab 7/8 tsim cov grooves asymmetric, txawv.",
      "keys_arranged_by_ascending_5ths_clockw": "Cov key teeb raws 5ths nce mus clockwise. Cov key nyob ib sab sib koom 6 ntawm 7 lub note. Mus clockwise ntxiv sharp; counter-clockwise ntxiv flat.",
      "every_musical_sound_contains_overtones": "Txhua lub suab nkauj muaj overtones saum lub fundamental. Lawv lub zog sib piv txiav txim rau timbre — vim li cas trumpet thiaj nrov txawv ntawm flute ntawm tib lub pitch.",
      "an_interval_is_the_distance_between_tw": "Ib qho interval yog qhov deb ntawm ob pitches, ntsuas hauv semitones. Frequency ratio txiav txim rau consonance (cov ratios yooj yim li 3:2 nrov du).",
      "plays_chord_notes_one_at_a_time_in_seq": "Ntaus cov chord notes ib qho zuj zus raws sequence. Up = qis mus siab, Down = siab mus qis. Tsim cov patterns ntws los ntawm cov chords nres.",
      "a_filter_removes_frequencies_above_low": "Filter tshem cov frequency saum (lowpass), hauv qab (highpass), los yog ib ncig (bandpass) ntawm ib lub cutoff frequency. Resonance (Q) ua kom cov frequency ze cutoff nrov dua, tsim ib lub ncov.",
      "tremolo_periodic_volume_changes_amplit": "Tremolo: kev hloov volume raws sijhawm (amplitude modulation). Vibrato: kev hloov pitch raws sijhawm (frequency modulation). Ob qho tswj los ntawm LFO (Low Frequency Oscillator).",
      "discovered_in_1983_a_noise_burst_feeds": "Tshawb pom xyoo 1983. Ib qho suab nrov luv nkag mus rau ib txoj delay luv heev uas muaj feedback. Lub sijhawm delay txiav txim rau pitch. Ib lub filter hauv feedback loop tswj qhov ci thiab decay. Ua raws li cov hlua ntiv ib yam li ntuj.",
      "the_sequencer_is_a_composition_tool_ea": "Sequencer yog ib lub cuab yeej sau nkauj. Txhua kauj ruam sawv cev rau ib feem ntawm beat. Kab melody teeb cov note muaj pitch, cov nruas ntxiv rhythm. Kev sau nkauj qhia yam koj tsim.",
      "notes_on_lines_and_spaces_represent_pi": "Cov note nyob saum kab thiab nruab nrab kab sawv cev rau pitch. Lub sijhawm ntev qhia los ntawm lub duab note: whole (○), half (𝅗𝅥), quarter (♩), eighth (♪). Staff siv 5 kab.",
