      "equal_temperament_12_notes_per_octave_": "Equal temperament: 12 notes hauv ib octave, ratio 2^(1/12). A4 = 440 Hz; A5 = 880 Hz. Bach's Well-Tempered Clavier (1722) tau yaum ntiaj teb rau qhov compromise no. Txhua note koj ntaus ntawm no nyob ntawm daim grid ntawd.",
