      "most_popular_music_sits_at_4_4_90_130_": "Feem ntau popular music nyob ntawm 4/4, 90-130 BPM. Hip-hop ~85-95, house 120-130, drum-and-bass ~170 (half-time feel). Kick ntawm 1+3, snare ntawm 2+4 = backbeat — lub hauv paus ntawm rock + pop.",
