      "common_mistake_handing_out_blocks_and_": "Kev yuam kev nquag: faib blocks tawm thiab ncaim mus. Yam tsis muaj kev qhia meej uas TXUAS lub manipulative rau lub symbol, cov tub ntxhais kawm feem ntau tsuas ua si nrog cov khoom ua si thiab tsis kawm dab tsi tshiab. Ib txwm xaus txhua manipulative session nrog: \"Qhia rau kuv rau daim ntawv dab tsi koj nyuam qhov ua.\"",
      "keeping_students_on_the_concrete_stage": "Cia cov tub ntxhais kawm nyob rau theem concrete ntev dhau",
      "a_4th_grader_who_still_needs_blocks_fo": "Ib tug 4th grader uas tseem XAV TAU blocks rau 23 + 47 muaj teebmeem. Blocks yog ib qho scaffold; yog lawv tsis txhob tshem tawm, fluency tsis loj hlob. Txav mus rau representational (duab) los txog qib 2-3, mus rau abstract (symbol) los txog qib 3-4. Rov nkag rau concrete rau cov concept tshiab xwb.",
      "skipping_the_representational_stage": "Hla theem representational",
      "most_rushed_teachers_go_from_blocks_st": "Feem ntau cov xibfwb maj mus los ntawm blocks ncaj qha mus rau \"tam sim no sau 4 + 5 = 9.\" Qhov ntawd skip lub iconic stage (kos dots, number lines, arrays). Witzel, Mercer & Miller (2003) pom tias qhov khoob ntawd yog qhov chaw uas feem ntau cov neeg kawm poob. Ib txwm suav nrog ib kauj ruam picture.",
      "letting_students_always_work_alone": "Cia cov tub ntxhais kawm ib txwm ua ib leeg",
      "manipulative_work_without_talk_is_half": "Manipulative work yam tsis muaj KEV THAM yog ib nrab ntawm tus nqi. Pair cov tub ntxhais kawm; kom lawv verbalize dab tsi lawv tab tom ua. Kev verbalization YOG kauj ruam consolidation uas txav qhov aksyon los ntawm \"ntiv tes paub\" mus rau \"lub hlwb paub.\"",
      "confusing_speed_with_understanding": "Confusing speed nrog understanding",
      "timed_fact_fluency_drills_can_make_stu": "Timed fact-fluency drills tuaj yeem ua rau cov tub ntxhais kawm sai dua rau cov procedure lawv tsis to taub (nrhiav \"math anxiety\" research: Boaler 2014). Slow manipulative work TSIS qis dua fast paper work rau K-3.",
      "mismatching_manipulative_to_standard": "Mismatching manipulative rau standard",
      "don_t_use_the_abacus_to_teach_fraction": "Tsis txhob siv abacus los qhia fractions. Tsis txhob siv pattern blocks los qhia place value. Lub Curriculum Map qhia tus manipulative twg daws CCSS twg — pib ntawd.",
      "praising_effort_but_not_strategy": "Qhuas kev siv zog tab sis tsis yog strategy",
      "saying_great_job_rewards_completion_sa": "Hais \"zoo heev!\" muab nqi zog rau completion. Hais \"kuv pom koj sim 3 trapezoids ua ntej hloov mus rau 6 triangles — dab tsi ua rau koj hloov?\" muab nqi zog rau kev xav. Ua kom tshwj xeeb.",
      "ignoring_student_invented_strategies": "Tsis quav ntsej cov strategy uas tub ntxhais kawm tsim",
      "a_student_who_shows_8_5_as_9_4_because": "Ib tug tub ntxhais kawm uas qhia 8 + 5 ua \"9 + 4\" (vim nws muab 1 los ntawm 5 thiab ntxiv rau 8 ua ntej) tau tsim ib qho make-ten strategy. Nthuav nws tawm; tis npe rau nws; qhia chav kawm los sim nws. Txoj kev textbook tsis yog tib txoj kev raug xwb.",
      "using_too_many_manipulatives_at_once": "Siv ntau manipulatives dhau ib zaug",
      "a_table_covered_in_4_different_manipul": "Ib lub rooj uas npog nrog 4 hom manipulative txawv yog recipe rau distraction, tsis yog differentiation. Xaiv IB rau ib lub lesson. Lwm 11 hauv cov cuab yeej no zoo heev — rau lwm cov lesson.",
      "forgetting_to_ask_why": "Tsis nco qab nug \"vim li cas?\"",
      "students_will_arrange_counters_correct": "Cov tub ntxhais kawm yuav tso counters kom raug vim lawv kawm cov txav, yam tsis to taub lub ntsiab lus. \"Vim li cas koj tso 1 hauv tens column?\" yuav tsum yog koj lo lus nug nug ntau tshaj.",
      "cleaning_up_too_quickly": "Ntxuav sai dhau",
      "a_built_construction_is_a_powerful_art": "Ib qho construction ua tiav yog ib qho artifact muaj zog — cia nws rau saum rooj thaum chav kawm tham txog nws. Save nws rau Library yog koj xav tau nws rov qab tag kis. Tsis txhob ua kom cov tub ntxhais kawm rhuav ib qho build nyuaj rau \"npaj rau cov ntsiab lus tom ntej.\"",
      "asking_only_convergent_questions": "Nug cov lus nug convergent xwb",
      "what_is_4_3_has_one_answer_convergent_": "\"4 + 3 yog dab tsi?\" muaj ib lo lus teb (convergent). \"Qhia kuv 7 ua peb txoj kev txawv\" muaj ntau (divergent). Cov lus nug divergent qhia tias cov tub ntxhais kawm xav li cas — qhov ntawd yog qhov kev ntsuam xyuas tseem ceeb.",
      "about_math_manipulatives": "Txog Math Manipulatives",
