      "the_pollen_basket_on_the_hind_tibia_ca": "The pollen basket on the hind tibia. Can hold up to 15mg of pollen — one-third the bee's body weight. Foragers moisten pollen with nectar to make it stick.",
      "the_queen_is_healthy_and_laying_up_to_": "The queen is healthy and laying up to 2,000 eggs per day — her own body weight in eggs!",
