      "scope_note": "This lab teaches the concepts of behaviour analysis. It does not qualify anyone to run a functional behaviour assessment or write a behaviour plan — that is supervised professional work, and the function of a real behaviour is a hypothesis you test with data, not a label you read off a description.",
      "sec_analysis": "Analysing the contingency",
