      "the_skinner_box_visual_frame_should_no": " The Skinner-box visual frame should not be adjacent to \"how to handle a kid in crisis\" content — different tonal space, different ethical weight. The Toolkit covers the PBIS three-tier framework, the FBA process end to end, the four functions of behaviour and a twelve-vignette Function Sleuth for identifying them, the eight components of a BIP with a drafting exercise, a token-economy builder with its pitfalls, replacement behaviours mapped to functions, setting events (the slow triggers most plans miss), Geoff Colvin's seven-phase acting-out cycle, restraint and seclusion ethics anchored in Maine Chapter 33, CICO, and disproportionality data.",
