      "a_three_phase_observation_activity_1_k": "A three-phase observation activity: (1) keep your binocular reticle on a moving bird for 5 cumulative seconds, (2) fill a structured field log (date, location, behavior, weather, count), (3) write a brief reflective note. Saves to a personal notebook on your device.",
