      "five_types_of_force_matter_for_structu": "Five types of force matter for structural engineering. Every part of every bridge experiences some combination of these.",
      "flatter_arches_smaller_rise_need_much_": "Cov nkhaus tiaj dua (qhov siab me dua) xav tau lub zog thawb kab rov tav ntau heev. Cov nkhaus Roman feem ntau yog ib nrab voj voog (qhov siab = ib nrab qhov ntev) vim qhov ntawd — lub zog thawb nruab nrab thiab tiv thaiv tau yooj yim. Cov nkhaus hlau tiaj niaj hnub xav tau cov ncej ntug loj heev txuas rau hauv pob zeb, los yog qauv nkhaus khi uas muaj pas hlau kab rov tav ntawm lawj choj nqus lub zog thawb (kom ob sab ntug nqa qhov hnyav nqis xwb). Choj Sydney Harbour thiab Choj New River Gorge tsis yog nkhaus khi: lawv xa lawv lub zog thawb mus rau cov ncej ntug loj thiab pob zeb.",
      "floating_log_improvised_bridges": "Floating-log + improvised bridges",
      "floating_pontoon_bridge": "Floating (pontoon) bridge",
      "flowing_water_erodes_soil_from_around_": "Dej ntws tshoob av nyob ib ncig ntawm cov ncej choj. Thaum qhov tshoob tob tuaj, lub hauv paus poob chaw txhawb. Thaum kawg nws qaij los yog ncej tog. Schoharie Creek (1987, NY) pob thaum dej nyab vim dej tshoob. Xyoo 1989 choj Hatchie River (Tennessee) pob tom qab dej hloov kev mus tsoo ncej; NTSB pom tias lub xeev tsis tau ntsuam xyuas thiab kho qhov hloov kev ntawd. Kev kawm txog choj pob hauv Asmeskas qhia tias kwv yees 50-60% yog vim dej zoo li dej nyab thiab dej tshoob. Cov choj niaj hnub muaj cuab yeej saib dej tshoob + kev tiv thaiv (pob zeb loj, hlau ntsia, hauv paus tob dua). Txij xyoo 1991, FHWA kev qhia (Technical Advisory 5140.23) kom cov xeev kuaj cov choj hla dej rau kev pheej hmoo dej tshoob thiab ntsuam xyuas cov uas tsis ruaj.",
      "for_maine_students_families": "For Maine students + families: ",
      "force_per_unit_area_at_which_a_materia": "Force per unit area at which a material starts to deform permanently. Above this, the material is damaged even after the load is removed. In MPa (megapascals = N/mm²).",
