      "granite_basalt_sound_limestone_the_str": "Granite, basalt, sound limestone. The strongest natural foundation. Allowable bearing 5-15 MPa (and much higher with engineered anchors).",
      "ground_penetrating_radar_ultrasonics": "Ground-penetrating radar + ultrasonics",
      "grs_ibs_geosynthetic_reinforced_soil_i": "GRS-IBS (Av Txhawb Nrog Yas — Txheej Txheem Choj Sib Koom) hloov cov ncej ntug pob zeb hlau qub + ncej ntsia nrog cov txheej av xuab zeb nias sib hloov nrog daim yas txhawb zog (zoo li vas yas muaj zog heev). Qhov tshwm sim yog ib tug ncej ntug ruaj khov uas txhawb tug choj ncaj qha, tsis tas muaj ncej ntsia. Ncej ntug GRS tsim tau hauv ob peb hnub siv pawg ua av qub. Lawv pheej yig dua 25-60% piv rau ncej ntug qub, tshem lub qij nruab nrab ntawm choj + txoj kev (ib qho teeb meem kho nquag), thiab haum heev rau choj luv. Ntau pua tug choj GRS-IBS tau tsim hauv Asmeskas txij 2005, nrog tus nqi tu qis heev.",
