      "immersed_tube_tunnel": "Immersed-tube tunnel",
      "in_real_engineering_the_rule_of_thumb_": "In real engineering, the rule of thumb is safety factor ≥ 1.5 for steel structures. Why might the simulation show MARGINAL at sf 1-2 but SAFE only at sf ≥ 2?",
      "in_seismic_regions_pacific_rim_much_of": "In seismic regions (Pacific Rim, much of the western US, Japan, Chile, New Zealand), bridges must survive earthquakes. The ground SHAKES horizontally and vertically; the bridge's mass becomes a hammer driven against itself by inertia. Modern seismic design uses three main strategies: STRENGTH (don't break), DUCTILITY (deform plastically without breaking), and ISOLATION (decouple the bridge from the ground motion).",
      "in_the_simulation_build_it_in_real_lif": "In the simulation, build it. In real life, a physical model from cardboard, popsicle sticks, or 3D-printed parts.",
      "inca_rope_suspension_bridges": "Inca rope suspension bridges",
      "infrastructure_construction_accounts_f": "Kev tsim kho thiab khoom tsim tsev yog kwv yees 10-20% ntawm CO₂ tawm thoob ntiaj teb. Xyoo 1971 National Bridge Inspection Standards (tom qab Silver Bridge) tsim ib lub chaw khaws ntaub ntawv qhia tias kwv yees 1 hauv 15 tug choj Asmeskas nyob hauv xwm txheej tsis zoo; ntau txhiab tug yuav tau hloov hauv 20 xyoo tom ntej. Txoj cai Infrastructure Investment and Jobs Act (2021) pab nyiaj hloov choj ntau. Ua zoo: khoom carbon qis dua + siv tau ntev dua. Ua tsis zoo: pa phem tib yam, rov ua tej kev yuam kev qub.",
      "initializing_bridge_lab": "🌉 Initializing Bridge Lab...",
      "inquiry": "Inquiry",
      "instead_of_using_spmts_the_new_bridge_": "Hloov qhov siv SPMTs, tug choj tshiab raug tsim nyob ib sab ntawm tug choj qub saum cov ncej ib ntus. Thaum kaw kev luv luv, rhuav tug choj qub + zawv tug choj tshiab sab mus rau nws qhov chaw kawg saum jacks, rollers, los yog daim ncoo nplua. FHWA qhov kev pab Every Day Counts txhawb kev zawv choj, thiab kev kaw kev feem ntau kav 48 txog 72 teev los yog tsawg dua. Massachusetts I-93 Fast 14 (2011) siv lwm txoj kev ABC, muab choj tsim ua ntej tsa nrog crane, hloov 14 tug choj hauv 10 lub asthiv, txo kwv yees li 3 xyoo los ntawm lub sijhawm qub.",
      "interactive_arch_thrust_analyzer": "∩ Interactive arch thrust analyzer",
      "interactive_beam_bending_analyzer": "═ Interactive beam bending analyzer",
      "interactive_cable_stayed_analyzer": "✦ Interactive cable-stayed analyzer",
      "interactive_catenary_cable_analyzer": "⌣ Interactive catenary cable analyzer",
      "iron_desc": "The first metal used at scale for bridges. Strong in compression, brittle and weak in tension. Many 19th-century failures.",
      "islamic_golden_age_bridges": "Islamic Golden Age bridges",
      "john_a_roebling_invented_the_aerial_sp": "John A. Roebling tau txhim kho txoj kev tig hlua hlau saum huab cua los tsim hlua choj dai, siv rau xyoo 1855 Niagara Falls choj tsheb ciav hlau — txoj kev no yuav luag tsis hloov 170 xyoo tom qab. Nws tuag xyoo 1869 vim raug mob thaum ntsuas qhov chaw Choj Brooklyn; nws tus tub Washington los ua hloov + mob \"caisson disease\" thaum saib kev tog ncej. Washington tus poj niam Emily Roebling xa nws cov lus txib + tswj feem ntau qhov haujlwm rau kaum xyoo tom ntej. Choj Brooklyn qhib xyoo 1883 + tseem txhawb tsheb niaj hnub no.",
      "k_trusses_use_the_deep_beam_approximat": "K-trusses use the deep-beam approximation: the truss is treated like a single beam carrying the same total load. Maximum chord force ≈ M / h, where M is the bending moment and h is the truss height. The qualitative pattern (max chord at center, max diagonal force at ends) is correct, but per-member forces are not exact. Warren, Pratt, and Howe trusses use the exact Method of Joints solver.",
      "lateral_force_on_bridge": "Lateral force on bridge",
      "lateral_slide_in_construction": "Lateral slide-in construction",
      "legacy_lessons": "Legacy + lessons",
      "life_cycle_cost_analysis": "Life-cycle cost analysis",
