      "spec": "Spec",
      "specify_minimum_recycled_steel_content": "Teem qhov tsawg kawg ntawm hlau rov siv dua (kwv yees 90%+ nquag muaj rau hlau duab + hlau ntsia los ntawm qhov cub hluav taws xob, tsuas yog 25-30% rau daim hlau los ntawm qhov cub oxygen). Hloov ib feem xis mas nrog tshauv ya, slag, los yog av nplaum ci.",
      "spmts_are_massive_multi_axle_hydraulic": "SPMTs yog cov tsheb ntau qag loj heev uas tswj theem nrog hydraulic uas nqa tau tag nrho ib ntu choj — nquag hnyav ntau pua tons — thiab zawv rau nws qhov chaw thaum kaw kev loj. Txhua kab qag muaj nws tus kheej kev tig + hydraulic, yog li SPMT txav sab tau, tig ntawm qhov chaw tau, thiab cia li theem saum av tsis tiaj. Ntau lub SPMT txuas ua ke tau. Choj Cedar Street hla Route 9 hauv Wellesley, Massachusetts (2011) tau tsim saum ncej ib ntus ib sab kev; SPMTs ces zawv tug choj hlau ob ntu uas tiav lawm rau nws qhov chaw, thiab txoj kev kaw tsuas yog 62 teev hnub so.",
