      "stone_desc": "Muaj zog heev hauv kev nias, tsis muaj zog hauv kev rub. Hnyav. Nyob tau ntau txhiab xyoo yog tsim zoo. Rome tug Choj Pons Fabricius, tsim thaum 62 BCE, tseem sawv.",
