      "pioneer_of_cephalopod_cognition_explai": "Pioneer of cephalopod cognition explains why octopus intelligence is genuinely different from vertebrate intelligence.",
      "pippa_ehrlich_james_reed_s_documentary": "Pippa Ehrlich and James Reed's documentary about Craig Foster's year with a wild common octopus in a South African kelp forest won Best Documentary Feature at the 93rd Academy Awards. Netflix had released it on September 7, 2020.",
