      "with_predator_cost_off_always_pick_the": "Thaum Tus Nqi Tsiaj Tua KAW, xaiv tus noog zoo nkauj tshaj rau 12 zaug, ces Mus ceev. Pawg tsiaj nce mus thiab nyob ze qhov zoo nkauj siab tshaj. Tsis muaj dab tsi thawb rov qab.",
