      "disclosure_helps_they_can_pace_differe": "Disclosure helps. They can pace differently, repeat instructions, route around your specific stressors. A simple sentence works: \"I have ADHD. I will stay on task better if you tell me each instruction one at a time instead of stacking them.\"",
