      "every_25_40_seconds_your_coach_will_is": "Every 25–40 seconds your coach will issue a scanning prompt — what speed limit is up ahead, did you spot the pedestrian, etc. Answer aloud or just notice. The drill emphasizes habit, not grading.",
      "every_drive_control_click_any_key_to_s": "Every drive control. Click any key to see what it does.",
