      "common_weld_symbols_visual_reference": "Common weld symbols — visual reference",
      "complement_to_defect_hunt_that_one_tea": "Complement to Defect Hunt: that one teaches what defects LOOK like; this one teaches what CAUSED them. 10 weld defects (porosity, undercut, lack of fusion, burn-through, crater crack, overlap, slag inclusion, spatter, distortion, sugar oxidation). Pick the cause from 6 categories (heat too high/low, travel too fast/slow, contamination, technique).",
