      "arc_m_steady_goal": "In hands-on mode, lay a full pass by hand with uniformity of 75% or better and an average speed within 10% of the target travel speed.",
      "arc_m_steady_h1": "Watch the puddle, not the torch: a steady puddle size means a steady speed.",
