      "car2_lad_inplace": "✓ in the right place",
      "car2_lad_intro": "Order the list from the first credential a new welder earns (top) to the last (bottom). Drag a card, or use its ↑ ↓ buttons, then check your order.",
      "car2_lad_list_aria": "Credentials in your order, first at the top",
