      "cons9_neutral_feather": "No separate acetylene feather is visible.",
      "cons9_oxy_reference_r2": "Oxygen and acetylene burn together at the torch. These references distinguish neutral, excess-fuel (carburizing) and excess-oxygen (oxidizing) flames. Flame choice depends on the operation, material and the equipment and consumable manufacturer’s instructions.",
