      "dh2_obs_cleanband": "A frosty, matte white stripe right beside the bead along its length.",
      "dh2_obs_coldlap": "At the start of the bead: a sharp fold line along the toe. The metal looks like it is sitting on the plate rather than blending in.",
      "dh2_obs_crater": "In the dish at the end of the bead: fine dark lines branching out from the centre.",
      "dh2_obs_haz": "A darker band in the base metal, hugging the weld all the way round.",
      "dh2_obs_heattint": "Straw, bronze and blue colours on the plate next to the weld. Flat: no groove and no lump.",
      "dh2_obs_lof": "The bead looks narrow and humped here, with steep toes. Nothing you can name from the surface.",
      "dh2_obs_millscale": "A dark, flaky, blue-grey patch on the plate, well away from the weld.",
      "dh2_obs_overlap": "A rolled lip of weld metal past the edge of the bead, with a dark crevice under it.",
      "dh2_obs_plain_bead": "Even ripples and smooth toes. Nothing unusual under the reticle.",
      "dh2_obs_plain_plate": "Plain plate surface.",
      "dh2_obs_porosity": "Small round dark holes in the bead surface: pits that go into the metal.",
      "dh2_obs_ripple": "The ripples are a little closer together here, but the bead profile stays even and the toes stay smooth.",
      "dh2_obs_soapstone": "A thin, pale, chalky straight line drawn on the plate.",
      "dh2_obs_spatter": "Small round beads of metal stuck ON the plate beside the weld. They stand up from the surface.",
      "dh2_obs_tack": "A small, smooth hump where the bead is slightly wider and higher for a short distance. It blends into the bead on both sides.",
