      "hi4_identity": "Candidate: {value1} V × {value2} A ≈ {value3} V·A. With speed and process fixed, both gross and transferred kJ/in stay the same in this calculation.",
      "hi4_intro": "For arc-process inputs, capture the calculator settings to hold a local reference. Then exchange voltage for current while holding their product, speed, process and plate fixed. Exploring here leaves the calculator, energy run and notebook unchanged.",
      "hi4_lower": "Lower bound",
      "hi4_model_cap": "Model cap height",
