      "hull_plating_hsla_65_hsla_80_hy_80_hy__r2": "Hull plating (HSLA-65, HSLA-80, HY-80, HY-100 high-strength steels). Internal structure (bulkheads, frames). Piping systems (carbon steel + stainless + copper-nickel). Aluminum superstructure (sometimes). Every weld is inspected. Navy work follows NAVSEA rules rather than AWS D1.1: Technical Publication 248 (welder + procedure qualification), Tech Pub 278 (piping, machinery, pressure vessels) and MIL-STD-1689 (surface-ship hull structure).",
      "hunt6_crop_aria": "Locked close-up of committed finding {value1}, {value2}, at a light angle of {value3} degrees.",
