      "insp2_clause_h": "🔎 Find the clause — AWS D1.1:2020",
      "insp2_clause_intro": "CWI Part C rewards knowing where to look. For each task, pick the D1.1:2020 clause you would open first. (Editions up to 2015 used different numbers.)",
      "insp2_clause_opt": "Clause {value1} — {value2}",
