      "met4_sens_legend_film": "Cyan strip: oxide film at the exposed surface",
      "met4_sens_note": "Qualitative schematic, not to scale. Blue circles indicate chromium availability, not individual atoms; marks are not atom counts or proportions. The stages do not model a thermal cycle, exposure time, corrosion rate or risk.",
