      "met7_crystal_intro": "Inspect the atomic site positions behind the BCC and FCC names. Choose a crystal reference, then highlight its corners or center sites.",
      "met7_crystal_model_note": "Schematic site markers show positions, not atom sizes or physical lattice lengths. Both views use the same reference cube and projection. These crystal references are independent of the temperature and carbon controls above; they do not predict phase fractions or cooling. The notes below also describe larger microstructures such as pearlite and bainite.",
