      "metal10_inside": "Inside pipe (bore)",
      "metal10_intro": "In this conventional GTAW pipe example, the torch shields the weld face from outside. Backing gas protects the root on the inside. Select a surface to trace that relationship.",
      "metal10_note": "Schematic section through the upper pipe wall, not to scale. Colored regions identify external shielding and internal backing gas; their sizes are illustrative. Actual backing requirements follow the qualified procedure.",
      "metal10_outside": "Outside pipe",
      "metal10_root": "Root · inside",
      "metal10_root_detail": "In this pipe example, argon backing gas protects the root-side surface. The backing region is inside the pipe, on the other side of the wall from the torch.",
