      "pathways_probe_debt": "Debt at graduation in this model: {value1}. This is the graduation total, not a balance at the selected age.",
      "pathways_probe_explain": "Read the rows together: years in school delay paid work; starting pay and raises change yearly earnings; loan payments reduce yearly net. The cumulative line adds those yearly net amounts. Taxes and living costs are excluded by this model.",
      "pathways_probe_gross": "Gross pay that year",
      "pathways_probe_heading": "One age, three routes: {value1}",
      "pathways_probe_hint": "The vertical guide and all three readings move together. Cumulative net is pay minus loan payments through the selected age; annual figures describe the last completed model year.",
