      "proc2_angle_drag": "Drawn with a drag (backhand) angle: the electrode leans toward the direction of travel and its tip points back at the finished weld. Rule of thumb: if it makes slag, drag.",
      "proc2_angle_push": "Drawn with a push (forehand) angle: the torch points ahead, in the direction of travel.",
