      "safe2_hoc_aria": "Hierarchy of controls drawn as an upside-down pyramid, most effective at the top: 1 elimination, 2 substitution, 3 engineering controls, 4 administrative controls, 5 PPE. The number at the right of each band is how many cards you have placed there.",
