      "sym2_menu_desc": "Read and write AWS A2.4 welding symbols: a library drawn beside each joint, decoder practice, a Symbol Builder that checks every field, and a three-view bracket print to read.",
      "sym2_menu_desc_r3": "Connect welding symbols to their joints and full weld runs. Measure weld length, centre pitch and clear gaps, then practise decoding, build symbols with field-by-field feedback and read a three-view bracket print.",
      "sym2_menu_desc_r4": "Compare ten welding-symbol details with the same symbol without that detail, using matching drawing scales. Connect symbols to joints and full weld runs, measure length and pitch, then practise decoding, build symbols with feedback and read a three-view bracket print.",
      "sym2_mod_allaround": "Weld all around",
