      "sym2_r4": "Stick (E7018) on 3/8\" plate, vertical-up",
      "sym2_r5": "TIG on 1/16\" stainless",
      "sym2_r6": "Pipe welding 6G (root, hot pass, fill, cap)",
      "sym2_r6_note": "Several passes per joint plus fit-up and inspection, so pipe is estimated per joint or per diameter-inch from shop history, not from arc travel speed.",
      "sym2_rate_row": "Arc travel {value1}-{value2} in/min · operating factor about {value3}% · about {value4}-{value5} ft of weld per paid hour",
      "sym2_rates_hdr": "Weld time by process (single-pass plate work, representative)",
      "sym2_rates_note": "The arc is only on part of the paid hour: fit-up, tacking, cleaning, moving and changing wire or rod take the rest. That share is the operating factor. Feet per paid hour = travel speed (in/min) × 60 ÷ 12 × operating factor. Multi-pass welds divide it again by the number of passes; use your shop's own records when you have them.",
      "sym2_sh_backing": "a half circle with its flat side on the reference line",
      "sym2_sh_bevel": "a vertical line and an angled line meeting on the reference line",
      "sym2_sh_fillet": "a right triangle with its vertical leg on the left",
      "sym2_sh_j": "a vertical line with a curve bending away from it",
      "sym2_sh_plug": "an open rectangle sitting on the reference line",
      "sym2_sh_seam": "a circle with two parallel lines through it",
      "sym2_sh_spot": "a circle",
