      "sym2_tri4_use": "Braces and gussets at 30° or 60°. Side ratios 1 : √3 : 2. If the short side = 3\", long side = 5.196\", hypotenuse = 6\".",
      "sym2_tri5_use": "Miter cuts at corners. Both legs equal, hypotenuse = leg × √2. If leg = 4\", hypotenuse = 5.657\".",
