  "readinglib_opt2_body": "Qhib ib phau ntawv thiab nias 🌐 Txhais. Siv tau txawm tias rau cov lus uas StoryWeaver tsis tshaj tawm (lus Somali, lus Ukraine, …), thiab kev nyeem tawm suab tseem siv tau. Cov ntawv yog AI txhais — tus tshaj tawm tsis tau tshuaj xyuas — thiab kev nyeem tawm suab ci txhua lo lus muaj nyob rau tsab qub xwb. Zoo tshaj rau kev pab cov tub ntxhais kawm tshiab tuaj hnub no; muab cov tub ntxhais kawm nyeem nrog tsab qub thaum koj ua tau.",
  "readinglib_opt2_title": "Kev txhais lus AI Instant - txhua yam lus, tam sim no",
  "readinglib_opt3_body": "StoryWeaver tshaj tawm ua 300+ hom lus. Ib qho ntawm lawv tuaj yeem muab ntxiv rau hauv lub tsev qiv ntawv no nrog cov ntawv pov thawj (thiab cov lus piav qhia qhov twg nws muaj) hauv kev hloov tshiab app ceev - qhia koj tus neeg saib xyuas AlloFlow hom lus koj xav tau.",
