    "fillable_title": "Ua kom sau tau",
    "hero_text": "Ua Kom Nkag Tau Yooj Yim khiav txhua yam nws tus kheej: kuaj → kho → rov kuaj kom txog lub hom phiaj → npaj txhij rub tawm. Rau feem ntau ntaub ntawv, qhov no txaus lawm.\n**Vim li cas tseem ceeb:** kab txheej txheem tsim los kom nyab xeeb — tsis tso ntsiab lus poob ntsiag to, thiab AI txoj hauj lwm raug kuaj dua los ntawm cov cai txhua zaug.",
    "hero_title": "Txoj kev ib nias xwb",
    "plain_text": "Rov sau tag nrho daim ntaub ntawv ua lus yooj yim (xaiv qib kawm). Khaws qhov tseeb, kuaj qauv, daim qub tseem yog tus thawj — thiab nws muaj nws tus kheej qhov piv, suab, thiab tagged PDF.",
    "plain_title": "Phau nyeem yooj yim",
    "report_text": "Cov ntawv ceeb toom kev nkag tau yooj yim uas luam tau — rau koj cov ntaub ntawv khaws, IEP, los yog koog tsev kawm ntawv. Kuj muaj phau kos npe pov thawj thiab.\n**Vim li cas tseem ceeb:** tsev kawm ntawv pej xeem muaj luag hauj lwm raws cai (ADA Title II). Daim ntawv ceeb toom muaj hnub tim qhia tej uas kuaj thiab kho yog pov thawj tseem ceeb.",
    "report_title": "Ntawv ceeb toom & ntaub ntawv teev",
    "save_text": "Khaws Hauj Lwm khaws tag nrho zaug ua ib daim ntaub ntawv — rov thauj tom qab ces txhua yam rov qab los. Kuj khaws daim thaub qab nws tus kheej tom qab txhua zaug kho.\n**Vim li cas tseem ceeb:** hauv Gemini Canvas, tsis muaj dab tsi nyob tom qab kaw lub tab TSHWJ TSIS YOG ntaub ntawv rub tawm — daim ntaub ntawv hauj lwm YOG koj qhov khaws. Tag kev saib qhia lawm — nias Ua Kom Nkag Tau Yooj Yim thaum npaj txhij!",
    "save_title": "Koj rov qab los tau ib txwm",
    "score_text": "AlloFlow qhov kev kwv yees nws tus kheej: muab ntau qhov kev tshuaj xyuas AI ywj pheej los nrhiav qhov nruab nrab, sib xyaw 50/50 nrog OB lub cav cai uas ua raws nraim (axe-core + IBM Equal Access — thaum lawv tsis pom zoo, qhab nia qis dua yeej).\n**Vim li cas nws tseem ceeb:** nws ncaj ncees, tab sis nws tsis yog daim ntawv pov thawj. Rau kev kuaj xyuas ywj pheej, thov siv PAC los yog veraPDF, ces rov saib qhov kev nyeem raws kab thiab lub ntsiab lus nrog lub cuab yeej nyeem npo thiab ib tug kws tshaj lij txog kev nkag mus tau.",
    "score_title": "Qhab nia, ncaj ncees",
    "settings_text": "Cov hauv paus twb tsim nyog lawm. Yog koj xav tau: ntau zaug kuaj = qhab nia ruaj dua, qhab nia hom phiaj txiav txim thaum kab khiav nws tus kheej nres.\n**Vim li cas tseem ceeb:** ntau zaug siv AI quota txhua hnub thiab sij hawm ntau dua — cov hauv paus sib npaug zoo. Lub ntsuas siv hauv kev teeb tsa AI qhia qhov siv tiag.",
    "settings_title": "Kev teeb tsa (yeem siv)",
    "tabs_text": "Tig mus rau tab Daim Qub txhua lub sij hawm saib daim ntaub ntawv zoo li cas ua ntej kho.\n**Vim li cas tseem ceeb:** thaum niam txiv, thawj coj, los yog pawg IEP nug tias \"dab tsi hloov tiag?\", lo lus teb nyob ib nias xwb — thiab qhov saib Piv qhia ob phau nyob ib sab.",
    "tabs_title": "Ua ntej thiab tom qab",
    "translate_text": "Txhais tag nrho daim ntaub ntawv rau tsev neeg — ntaus TXHUA hom lus. Kuaj qauv ib ntu zuj zus, daim txhais muaj nws tus kheej qhov piv/suab/tagged-PDF rub tawm, thiab kab ceeb toom tshuaj xyuas.\n**Vim li cas tseem ceeb:** IDEA yuav tsum muaj ntaub ntawv tseem ceeb ua niam txiv hom lus.",
