    "field_teacher_decides": "Sib tham txog cov kev xaiv ua ke. Koj tus xibfwb xaiv rau kev mus tshawb nrhiav.",
    "field_three_choices": "Nqa khoom siv tam sim no, npaj koj qhov kev tshawb nrhiav tom ntej, los sis npaj ib pab neeg rau koj qhov kev txhim kho tom ntej. Txhua qhov kev xaiv txhawb ib daim phiaj xwm txawv; kev xaiv tsis siv kev txav.",
    "field_trade_saved": "Pauv khoom siv lawm",
    "field_venture_rules": "Cov xwm txheej soj ntsuam muab tau kev tshawb nrhiav sim hmoov hloov ib qho txiaj ntsig uas paub tseeb. Xaiv ib peev txheej: thawj lub pob txha khaws ntawm koj qhov kev tshawb nrhiav tshiab tiav tom ntej muab plaub lub cim rau 11–20 los sis tsis muaj rau 1–10, txhua yam muaj 50% feem. Lub pob txha zog thib ob tsis hloov qhov muaj feem. Kev taug kev, kev txhim kho, thiab kev sim tsis tiav khaws qhov kev sim hmoov cia; tsis muaj khoom plig yooj yim poob.",
    "field_venture_saved": "Txais kev tshawb nrhiav sim hmoov lawm",
    "file_contents": "Ib daim ntawv rooj ua si muaj nws cov ntaub ntawv zaj lus qhia, cov haujlwm, cov lus teb yog, thiab cov lus qhia me. Nws tsis suav nrog cov neeg kawm lub npe, lus teb, los sis qhov ua tau hauv lub sij hawm tam sim no.",
