    "relay_payout_schedule": "Koj kab kev xa sib txuas",
    "relay_private_help": "Kev piv kab thiab kuaj cov chaw nres tsis lees paub thiab tsis txav pab. Ib tsab ntawv xa ib zaug xwb: kev xa khoom los sis kev xa sib txuas. Kev xa sib txuas xaiv tau thiab yeej tsis thaiv kev xaus kev mus tshawb nrhiav.",
    "relay_progress": "{count} ntawm 2 qhov kev xa tiav lawm",
    "relay_receipt": "Koj qhov kev xa sib txuas ob chaw nres khaws cia lawm. Tsis muaj khoom siv ntxiv thiab pab tsis tau txav. Xaus cov kev txav taug kev tom qab ntawm cov chaw nres no raws kab kom sau tau txhua lub khoom plig ib zaug.",
    "relay_receipt_optional": "Koj qhov kev xa sib txuas tseem xaiv tau. Kev hla los sis mus txog lub chaw nres thib ob ua ntej thawj lub tsis tau khoom plig.",
    "relay_reminder_help": "Kev hla tsis suav. Kev tshawb nrhiav thiab kev txhim kho khaws koj qhov kev xa sib txuas npaj txhij. Nws xaiv tau; koj xaus tau kev mus tshawb nrhiav yam tsis tas ua tiav ob qhov kev xa.",
