    "relay_second_ready": "Koj thawj qhov kev xa them lawm. Xaus ib qhov kev txav taug kev tom qab ntawm lub chaw nres thib ob kom sau tau khoom plig kawg.",
    "relay_sequence_rule": "Xaus ib qhov kev txav taug kev tom qab ntawm chaw nres 1, ces lwm qhov ntawm chaw nres 2. Kev hla ib lub chaw nres los sis mus xyuas chaw nres 2 ua ntej tsis tau dab tsi. Txhua qhov kev xa tsuas them ib zaug xwb; cov khoom siv qub ntawm qhov chaw tsis raug sau dua.",
